<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone handa chijijandikwe na Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ayoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jammbone chijijandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani Jammbone chiijandikwe na Ayohana nga chimo cha hitabu ncheche mu Lilagano Liyono hiikongolela umomi gwa Ayesu Kilisito. Kila chimo cha hitabu yeneyo chikwemwa “Injili” lilobhe lilibhile na maana ja “Ngani Jammbone.” Hitabu heye hikajandikwa na Amatayo, Amaluko, Aluka na Ayohana baada ja kujomoka Ayesu. Ngani Jammbone handa jiijandikwe na Ayohana hikajandikwa na Ayohana mu yaaka ya 90 pabhabelekwa Ayesu Akilsito. Hata henela chitabu ngalongela Ayohana nga jwaakajandika, na chibhakajandika hilandana muno na gwagola gugubhile mu balua ja 1 Ayohana, 2 Ayohana, na 3 Ayohana. Bhangi pakati ja bhenibhala bhabhakajandika lolo bhankongolela Ayohana kubhee atendita kutama mu chilambo cha ku Efeso mu machobha genago, henela ikomboleka chitabu chenjeni chikajandikwa mu chilambo cha ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ayohana atendakulongela pangali kuhiya ligongo lya kujandika chitabu nga kwajangatila bhandu bhakombolange kuhobhalela Ayesu Kilisito, Mwana jwa Annoongo jwaabhi amomi 20:30. Kwa kuhobhalela henela bhakombolange kubhee na umomi gwa machobha goa kwa kutama handa chibhapala Ayesu. Chitabu chenjeni chikajandikwa ligongo lya Bhayahudi na bhenibhala bhanga Bhayahudi. Ngani Jammbone jijikajandikwa na Ayohana kwa namuna teno chilekine na injili yeniyela itatu yengi. Ayohana akalangia mu yeniyela yakangachika hibhakaatenda Ayesu, na angajanika muno nnani ja yeniyela yakangachika hijingi hibhakatenda Ayesu na kulandanakia. Hikubho hiibhokile yengi hijingi hikolongwa handa kubatichwa kwa Ayesu na kujigwa kwabhe palulemba kabhele gangajandikwa mu Ngani Jammbone jenjeni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Ayohana atendakuijemeka injili nlyango 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Ayohana atendakujandika ngani ja yakangachika yengi hibhakaitenda Ayesu 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena atendakulongela hikubho hikolongwa hibhakatenda Ayesu mu umomi gwabhe na hiikaajambua malilo gakwe na kuyoka 13:1-20:31</para>
  <para style="io">Ayohana atendakujomolekea injili jabhe mu nlyango gwa 21 abhikongolela Ayesu pabhakaabhokelanga bhenibhala bhandu pabhakayoka, na kabhele atendakongolela gagakaatenda kujandika chitabu chenjeni.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Lilobhe likatendeka mmele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Pena kandai tangu hilebhe yoha yangahalakikwa, Lilobhe bhakibha, na jonojwe Lilobhe akibha pamo na Annoongo, na bhena bhakibha Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Nabhena Lilobhe akibha pamo na Annoongo kubhokela kandai. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kupetela jonojwe hilebhe yoha hikaahalakikwa, kupetela jonojwe Annoongo hakaalakia hilebhe yoa. Chakwa chilebhe chohachela changaahalakilwa pangali bhenabho. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Nkati jabhe mukibha na umomi na umomi gonogwe gukibha nhana gwa bhandu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Nhana gonogwe kung'anyima palubhendu, na lono lubhendu gwangakoombola kuguhima gono nhana.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Kukibha na mundu jumo jwaakatumwa kubhoka kwa Annoongo, lina lyabhe Ayohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Jonojwe akahika kwaalobholelanga bhandu ngani ja jono nhana. Bhakahika ili kupetela jonojwe bhandu bhoha bhajoange na kuhobhalela. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ayohana jwangabhee jono nhana, ila akahika kwalobholelanga bhandu ngani ja nhana. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Jonojwe nga nhana gwa kweli, nhana guguhika pachilambo, na kwamulikilanga bhandu bhoa. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Bahi, Lilobhe lyakibha pachilambo, na hilebhe yoha hikalakikwa kupetela jonojwe, nambo bhandu bha pachilambo bhangaamanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Bhakahika kwa bhandu bhabhe, nambo bhandu bhabhe bhene bhangampokelanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Nambo bhenibhala bhabhakaapokela na kwahobhalela, akaapekeanga uwecho gwa kutendeka bhana bha Annoongo, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />bhenabho bhangatendeka bhana bha Annoongo kwa kubhelekwa na akaabhelehi, wala kwa kupala bhandu, ila kwa kupala kwabhe Annoongo mwene. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Na bhena Lilobhe akatendeka mmele, akatama pamo na twenga. Na twenga tugubhweni nng'anyimo gwabhe, na nng'anyimo handa gwa Mwana jwa jika jwaakahika kubhoka kwa Atati, jwaatwelile wema gwa Annoongo na kweli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Ayohana bhakaalobholelanga bhandu ngani jabhe, atendita kweha lilobhe, “Ojojo nga jonijola junakannobholelanga kubhee, ‘Jwahika kuyeto jangu nga akolongwa kupunda nenga, kwakubhee akibha tangu nenga nangabhee.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwa kutongamanika kwabhe twenga twabhoa tupookile wema gwa Annoongo kwa kujimbika muno. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwakubhee Malagilo gakahika kwa kupetela ndela ja Amusa, nambo wema gwa Annoongo na kweli jiletitwe kupetela Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Jwakwa mundu jwammonite Annoongo. Nambo nga Amwana jikajakwe, jwaatekubhandila kwa Annoongo jonojwe nga jwaatekwatenda Annoongo bhamanyikane.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani ja Ayohana Ammatichaji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-2">Amatayo 3:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Amaluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Aluka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Jenjeni nga ngani ja Ayohana jibhakajilongela muuda akaakolo bha Bhayahudi konikola ku Yelusalemu pabhakatumanga akaakung'i na Bhalawi bhajaulange kwa Ayohana kwaakonya, “Mwenga nga aganiki?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ayohana bhangakana kwajangulanga, nambo akaalobholelanga, “Nenga ngabha Akilisito Mwakochi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bhakankonyanga, “Kwa henela, mwenga nga aganiki? Bholi, mwenga nga Aelia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ayohana akajaangula, “Ngabha nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bhakaakonya kabhele, “Mwenga nga bhenibhala alondohi bha Annoongo bhabhakalobholekwa jwaapakuhika?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ayohana akajaangula, “Ngabha nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ngapena bhakaakonya, “Ngocheni mwenga nga aganiki, ntulobholele na twenga tujaule kwalobholelanga bhabhatutumite. Bholi na mwenga nchikemabholi?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ayohana akaajangulanga kwa malobhe ga alondohi Aisaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Abhikulobhola, “Nenga nga jonijola alondohi bha Annoongo Aisaya jwaakalongela palulemba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Nnyululange ndela jibhapetela Hangwana.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakatumwanga na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Penapo bhakaakonya Ayohana, “Handa mwenga ngabha Akilisito, wala Aelia, wala bhenibhala alondohi bha Annoongo kwaniki ntenda kubaticha bhandu?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Ayohana akaajangulanga, “Nenga ndendakubaticha kwa machi, nambo abhile jumo jwajemite pakati jinunji yakubhee mwangammanya, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Jonojwe jwaatendakuhika kuyeto jangu nenga, nambo nenga ngapaalikwa hata kwaajogola migoji ya champali yabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Hikubho heyo hikatendeka konokwe ku Betania, kuntundu ja loochi Yolodani konokwe nga kubhatendita kubaticha Ayohana.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga Mwanangondolo jwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Malabhi jakwe Ayohana akaabhona Ayesu abhikunhikila, akalobhola, “Hojo nga Mwana ngondolo jwa Annoongo jwaatola mabohu goa ga bhandu pachilambo! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Hojo nga jonijola junakankongolelanga ngani jabhe kubhee, ‘Apakuhika mundu kuyeto jangu na nga akolo kupunda nenga kwakubhee akibha mmi tangu jangu nenga.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nenga na mwene nangammanya, nambo ndekuhika kubaticha bhandu kwa machi ili kwatenda bhandu bha chilambo cha ku Isilaeli bhapatange kunhelewa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Ayohana akalongela namuna chibhakaamanya Ayesu, abhikulongela, “Nakaabhona Mboomo jwa Annoongo abhikutuluka handa ngunda kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo na kutama nnani jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nenga nangaamanya, nambo jonijola jwaandumite kubaticha bhandu kwa machi atekunobholela, ‘Mundu jonijola jumpakummona Mboomo abhikwatulukia kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo na kutama nnani jakwe, jonojwe nga jwaabaticha kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Nenga na mwene ndekulola chikubho hecho na ndendakuchibiticha kubhee hojo nga Mwana jwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhachijigana bhakujemeka bha Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Lichobha lilikahika, Ayohana akajema palapala kabhele pamo na bhenibhala bhabhaajigana bhabhe bhabhele. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Pabhakaabhona Ayesu atendakupeta, akalobhola, “Nnole! Hojo nga Mwanangondolo jwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhele pabhakaajoa Ayohana abhikulongela malobhe genago, bhakankagula Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Ayesu akatendebhuka, akaabhona bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhatendakunkagula, akaakonyanga, “Nnoleanga chiniki?” Na bhenaangota bhakajangulanga, “Alabi ntama koji?” Alabi maana jakwe bhabhajigana. <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Nhikange nnolange.” Bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhakankagula, bhakapabhona pabhatendita kutama, bhakatama nabho lichobha helyo kwa kubhee pabhakaabhandikianga ikibha handa chaa komi kimuho.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Aandulea, jwaakibha anung'una jwabhe Asimoni Apetulo, akibha jumo jwa bhena bhabhele bhabhakaajoa Ayohana abhikulongela, na bhabhankagula Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Palapala Aandulea akaalolea anung'una bhabhe Asimoni na kwalobholela, “Twaabhweni Amasiha.” Amasiha maana jwakwe jwaagulikwe na Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ngapena Aandulea akaapeleka Asimoni kwa Ayesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Ayesu pabhakaalola Asimoni akaalobholela, “Mwenga nga Asimoni mwana jwa Ayohana. Nangocheni mpakemwa Akefa.” Akefa kwa chigiliki nga Apetulo na Apetulo maana jakwe nga “Luhala.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwaakema Afilipo na Anatanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Malabhi jakwe Ayesu akaamuha kujaula ku Galilaya. Konokwe akaakolela Afilipo, akaalobholela, “Ngagule.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Afilipo na annung'una jwabhe Apetulo bhakibhanga bhandu bha kuchilambo cha Betisaida. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Afilipo akaakolela Anatanaeli na kwaalobholela, “Tunkolile Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti, mwana jwa Ayosefu jonijola Amusa jwaakajandika ngani yabhe mu chitabu cha Malagilo, na yakubhee akaalondohi bha Annoongo bhakajandika ngani yabhe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Anatanaeli akaakonya Afilipo, “Bholi, chilebhe chammbone chikombola kubhoka ku Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Afilipo akaajangula, “Nhike nnole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Penipala Ayesu pabhakabhona Anatanaeli atendakwahikila, akalobhola, “Nnolange! Hojo nga Aisilaeli mwene, nkati jabhe jwanga unami.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Anatanaeli akaakonya, “Henela nkombwilebholi, kumanya nenga?” Ayesu akaajangula, “Tangu Afilipo bhangankema pankibha pahi ja nkongo gwa ntini, nenga nakammanya.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Penapo Anatanaeli akaalobholela, “Bhannyigana, mwenga nga Mwana jwa Annoongo. Mwenga nga Amwenye bha chilambo cha ku Isilaeli!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Bholi, nhobhalile kwakubhee ndekunnobholela pankibha pahi ja ntini? Mpakulola makolongwa muno kupunda gangani.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, mpakulolanga kunani kwa Annoongo kubhikujogoka na akaatumichi bha kunani bha Annoongo bhabhikukwelanga na kutuluka ligongo lya Mwana jwa Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulombela kuchilambo cha Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Lichobha lya tatu kukibha na kuhangalila ulombela konokwe ku Kana ja kuchilambo cha Galilaya. Na anyongo bhabhe Ayesu akibha penapo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ayesu na bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakalaalikwa konokwe kuulombela. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai pajikajomoka, anyongo jwabhe akaalobholela Ayesu, “Divai jijomwike.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Choonde mwe anyongo, nkotokunobholela cha kutenda. Saa jakutenda lihengo lyangu lyangahika.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ngapena anyongo jwabhe Ayesu akaalobholelanga bhenibhala akaatumichi, “Lyoalela libhapakunnobholelanga, ntendange.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Penapo pakibha na hibhega sita ja kubhekela machi hiikahalakilwa na maganga, handa chiiyobhalilike kwa Bhayahudi kuchijelejea ili kondekwa kwaachalila Annoongo, kila chibhega chikatola mabede nhano au sita. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Ayesu akaakulumikia bhenibhala akaatumichi, “Muitweleange hibhega yeneyo machi.” Na bhenaangota bhakatweleanga mpaka nnani. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Ngocheni ntekange, mumpelekeange akolo bha kuhangalala.” <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Akolo bha kuhangalala pabhagapaa machi genigala akagakolela gatekutendebhuka kubhee divai. Angamanya kujikabhokela divai jenejo nambo bhenibhala akaatumichi bhabhakatekanga machi genigala akaamanyanga. Ngapena akolo jonojwe akankema hangwana bha ulombela panyenje, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akaalobholela, “Bhandu bhoa kujemeka kwa kubhoa divai ja kuhalala, ngapena bhandu handa bhakolwililinge, ngapena pabhaletanga divai jenijela jangaalala nambo mwenga mmoite divai ja kuhalala mpaka ngocheni!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Chenjeni nga chikibha chilolelo cha kujemeka chibhakatenda Ayesu konokwe ku chilambo cha ku Kana ja ku Galilaya, konokwe Ayesu akalangia ng'anyimo gwabhe na bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhakanhobhalela.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Pagakapeta genago, Ayesu akatuluka pamo na anyongo jwabhe na akaanung'una bhabhe, na bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe, bhakajaulanga ku chilambo cha Kapelenaumu kubhakatamanga machobha kachoko.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakujaula pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Amatayo 21:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Amaluko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Aluka 19:45</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka ja Bhayahudi pajikabhandikila, henela Ayesu akakwela kujaula chilambo cha Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Konokwe pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo Ayesu akaakolelanga bhandu habhikuuchanga ng'ombe na ngondolo na ngunda na bhandu bhangi bhakatamanga pahi pamecha bhabhikutindiganya mbiya. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ayesu akahalakia nhyakato gwa ng'oji, akaabhenganga bhoa panja ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo pamo na ngondolo na ng'ombe yabhenji, hela hela akapendekulana mecha ja bhenibhala bhandu bhabhatindiganya mbiya na kujita mbiya yabhenji. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akaalobholelanga bhenibhala bhabhahuchitanga ngunda, “Mmoange hilebhe yinunji! Nkombolangabholi kujitenda nyuumba ja Atati bhangu kubhee choko!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhakakombokelanga Majaandiko ga Annoongo gagalobhola, “Upalyo gwangu kwa nyuumba jinu gupakungoma.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ngapena akaakolongwa bha Bhayahudi bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Mpakombola kutenda chilolelo niki ili kutulangia twenga handa nkweti mamulaka ga kutenda hikubho heye?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Mmomolange heje Nyuumba ja Annoongo, na nenga mbakuchenga kabhele kwa machobha gatatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Akaakolo bha Bhayahudi bhala bhakaakonyanga, “Nyuumba heje ja Annoongo jikachengwa kwa yaaka alobaini na chita, na mwenga nkombolabholi kuchenga kwa machobha gatatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Nambo Nyuumba ja Annoongo yakubhee Ayesu jibhatendita kulongelea nga mmele gwabhe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Pabhakayokekwa, bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakakombokelanga kubhee akalongela genago, ngapena pabhakahobhalelanga Majaandiko ga Annoongo na malobhe gala gabhatendita kulongela Ayesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakumanya mitima jabhenji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ayesu pabhakibha chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu ku lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka, bhandu bhajingi bhakanhobhalela ligongo lya hilolelo na hikubho hijingi yakangachika hibhatendita kutenda. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Nambo Ayesu jwangahobhalela kuhobhalela kwabhenji kwaachabhe kwakubhee akaamanya chibhabhilinge mu mitima jabhenji. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Jwangapala mundu joajola kwalobholela choachela ngani ja bhandu abho, ligongo Ayesu akagamanya goa gagabhile mu mitima ja bhandu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu na Anikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Pakibha na akolo bhamo Bhayahudi, bha chibhoga cha Mafalisayo, lina lyabhe Anikodemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Lichobha limo kilo Anikodemo akaajendelela Ayesu, akaalobholelea, “Alabi, tuimanyi kubhee mwenga nga bhannyigana bhantumitwe na Annoongo, kwa kubhee jwakwa mundu jwaakombola kutenda hilolelo hiintendite mwenga, handa Annoongo bhanga pamo na bhena.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Ndendakunnobholela kweli, mundu ngakombola kugubhona Umwenye gwa Annoongo handa ngabhelekwa pabhele.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Anikodemo akankonya, “Bholi, mundu akombolabholi kubhelekwa pabhele handa abhi anahota? Ngakombola kujiingila pabhele mu lutumbo lya anyongo bhabhe na kubhelekwa pabhele!” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Ndendakunnobholela kweli, jwakwa mundu joajola jwaapakombola kujiingila mu Umwenye gwa Annoongo handa ngabhelekwa kwa machi na kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mundu babhelekwa kwa mmele kwa atati na anyongo bhabhe, nambo mundu bhabhelekwa kwa mboomo kupetela Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nkotokangacha panannobholela mpalikwa kubhelekwa pabhele. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mboongo kupoga kohakola kujipala. Kupoga kwakwe ntendakujoa nambo ngakombola kumanya kujibhoka na kujijaula. Henela nga chiibhile kwa mundu joajola jwaabhelikwe na Mboomo ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Anikodemo akaakonya, “Bholi, hikubho handa yenjeni hikombolekabholi?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Mwenga nga bhannyigana mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli, nambo tangu ngaelewa hikubho heye? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ndendakunnobholela kweli, twenga tutendakunkongolelanga hikubho hiituimanyi na tutendakunkongolelanga hikubho yeniyela hiituibhonite, nambo mwangota ntendakananga ngani jitu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ndekunnobholelanga hikubho ya pachilambo, nambo mwangota mwangahobhalelanga, ngocheni mpakombolabholi kuhobhalela pambakunnobholelanga hikubho ya kunani kwa Annoongo? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Jwakwa mundu jwaajawile kujaula kunani kwa Annoongo nga Mwana jwa Mundu jikajabhe, jwaatulwike kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />“Handa Amusa chibhapakong'ondela nnani chidimu cha lijoka jwa chaba kwa nhimbati kwakola palulemba, hela hela kwa Mwana jwa Mundu chibhapakong'ondelwa nnani, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ili kila mundu jwanhobhalela apate umomi gwa machobha goa gwangapela. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ligongo helyo, Annoongo akaapalanga muno bhandu bha chilambo choa henela akammoa Mwana jwabhe jwa jikajabhe, ili kila mundu jwanhobhalela, bhabhee na umomi kwa machobha goa gwangapela. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ligongo Annoongo bhangaatuma Mwana jwabhe pachilambo kwahukunulanga bhandu bha pachilambo, ila kupetela Mwana jwabhe bhandu bhoa bhahokolewange.”<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Mundu joajola jwanhobhalela Mwana ngahukumulwa, nambo kwa jwajola jwanganhobhalela Mwana atekuhukumulwa, ligongo anganhobhalela Mwana jwa jikajabhe jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Henela nga bhandu chibhapakuhukumulwanga, na jono lumuli atekuhika bhandu bha pachilambo, nambo bhandu bha pachilambo bhatekupalanga lubhendu kupunda jono lumuli, ligongo lya hikubho hibhatendanga nga hibohu. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Mundu joajola jwaatenda hikubho hibohu atendakuguchimwa lumuli, na wala ngahika palumuli ligongo atendakujogopa yeniyela hikubho yabhe hibohu hibhatenda hipakubhonekana. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Nambo mundu jonijola jwaatenda gammbone kuhika palumuli, ili hikubho yabhe hibhonekane hiitendikwe kwa kwaakonda Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayohana Mbatichaji alongela ngani ya Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Pagakapeta genago, Ayesu na bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakajaulanga ku chilambo cha Yudea, na bhenaangota bhakatamanga konokwe kwa muuda abhikubaticha bhandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Hela hela Ayohana atendita kubhaticha bhandu konokwe ku Ainoni, kubhandikila na ku Selemu, kwa kubhee konokwe kukibha na machi gajingi. Bhandu bhajingi bhatendita kujaula konokwe na kubatichwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Machobha hago Ayohana akibha tangu kwaatabha mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ngapena bhangi pakati ja bhabhachijigana bha Ayohana bhakajemaka kutaukana na Bhayahudi bhamo ngani ja kuchijelejea ili kondekwa handa chiiyobhalilike kwaachalila Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Henela bhabhachijigana bhenibhala bhakaajendelela Ayohana bhakaalobholela, “Bhannyigana, mundu jonijola jwaakibha pamo na mwenga kuntundu ja loochi lwa Yolodani, jonijola junakannobholela ngani yabhe, ngocheni atendakubaticha, na kila mundu atendakwaajendelela!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Ayohana akaajangulanga, “Jwaka mundu joajola jwaakombola kupata chilebhe choachela handa jwangapata kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mwangota mwabhene ntendakumanyanga kweli panakannobholelanga, ‘Nenga ngabha Akilisito jwahagulikwe na Annoongo, nambo ndumitwe naalongolele!’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Hangwana ulombela nga jwaannombela mwikege jwaulombela. Nambo aganja bhabhe hangwana ulombela jwaajema kubhandikila na jonojwe na kwajohanikia, kuhachuka muno penipala pabhalijoa lilobhe lyabhe. Ligongo hele kuhangalala kwangu kukwelite. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Akilisito jwahagulikwe na Annoongo apaalikwa kujonjokeka kutopelwa muno na nenga mbalikwa kupongoka kutopelwa.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani ja jonijola jwahika kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Jwaagulikwa kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo nga akolo kupunda yoa. Jwaabhoka pachilambo nga bha pachilambo, na kulongela hilebhe ya pachilambo, nambo jwahika kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo nga akolo kupunda yoa. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Bhenabho kulongela gaagabhweni na kugajoa, nambo bhakwa amundu bhoabhala bhabhahobhalela malobhe gakwe gabhalongela. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mundu joajola jwaakonda ngani jabhe alangia kubhee Annoongo nga bha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Jonojwe jwaatumitwe na Annoongo kulongela ngani ya Annoongo, kwa kubhee Annoongo kuntwelea muno Mboomo jabhe pangali chipemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Atati atendakumpala Mwana na ampekie hilebhe yoa mmabhoko gabhe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Mundu joajola jwanhobhalela Mwana akweti umomi gwa machobha goa gwangapela, nambo mundu jwakana kunhobhalela Mwana ngapata umomi gwa machobha goa gwangapela, nambo apakuhigalila mu hukumulo ja Annoongo.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu na mwikege Nsamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo bhakajoanga kubhee Ayesu atendita kwatendanga bhandu bhajingi kubhee bhabhachijigana na kwabaticha kupunda Ayohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Hata handa Ayesu, bali bhabhachijigana bhabhe nga bhabhatendita kubaticha. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Bahi, Ayesu pabhakagajoa genago, akabhoka chilambo cha ku Yudea na kubhuja ku chilambo cha ku Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />mu ulendo gwabhe ikapalikwa kupetela ku Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Bahi, akahika mu chilambo chimo cha ku Samalia chichikemitwa Sikali, kubhandikila na ng'onda gonigola yakubhee Ayakobo akampekea mwana jwabhe Ayosefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Mahali penapo nga kukukabhee na lilibha lya Ayakobo. Ayesu akatama ngulugulu mwa lilibha helyo ligongo lya kutotokela kwa ulendo gonogwe. Ikibha muhi handa chaa chita.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mwikege jumo Ansamalia akahika penapo kuteka machi, Ayesu akaalobholela, “Mbekee machi ng'wee.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Muda hogwe bhenibala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakibha bhajaulinge kunnyini kuhemela chakulya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nambo mwikege jonojwe akaajangula, “Mwenga nga Ayahudi na nenga nga Nsamalia, kwa niki ntendakunyopa nimpekee machi ga kung'wee?” Akalongela henela ligongo Bhayahudi na Bhasamalia ngakwelekana.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Handa nkaimanyite ngwaupa jibhabhoa Annoongo nga ganiki jwaannobholela, ‘Mbekee machi ng'wee,’ mwenga nkaajopite bhenabho, na bhenabho akampekie machi gagapakuntenda mee umomi gwa machobha goa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mwikege jonojwe akaajangula, “Akolo, mwenga mwangali nteko gwa kutekela machi, na lilibha hele nga litandamano, machi genago gagaleta umomi gwa machobha goa mugapatite koji? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Bholi, mwenga nga mwakolo kupunda atati bhitu Ayakobo jwaatupekie hele lilibha? Bhena mwene pamo na bhana bhabhe na hilangwa yabhe bhakwang'wenganga machi ga hele lilibha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Kila mundu jwaang'wee machi ga hele lilibha, nyoota jipakwaakolela kabhele. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Nambo jwaajola jwaapakung'wee machi gambakwapekea nenga, nyoota ngaakolela ng'o. Machi gambakwapekea gapakubhee cheembwe nkati jabhe, gagaelela umomi gwa machobha goa gwangapela.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mwikege jonojwe akaalobholela, “Mwe mwakolo, mbekee machi genago ngotokubhona nyoota kabhele, na ngotokuhika kabhele pambani kuteka machi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nnyaule nkaakeme hangwana bhinu, nhike nabho pambani.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mwikege jonojwe akaajangula, “Nenga nangali hangwana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Ayesu akaalobholela, “Pannongela kubhee mwangali hangwana penapo nnongile maha. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ligongo nkalombwa na akanalome nhano, na bhenibhala bhantama nabho ngocheni ngabha hangwana bhinu. Penapo nnongile kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mwikege jonojwe akaalobholela, “Mwe mwakolo, chimmona nenga mwenga mwa alondoi bha Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Akanahota bhitu bha ku Samalia bhakaachalilanga Annoongo pa litombi hele, nambo mwangota Bhayahudi nnobholanga kubhee mahali pa kwaachalila Annoongo nga konokwe kuchilambo cha Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Mwe mma nhobhalele, machobha gatendakuhika yakubhee ngaachalilanga Atati nnani ja litombi hele, wala konikola ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mwangota Bhasamalia ntendakwaachalila mwangaamanya, nambo twenga Bhayahudi twaamanyi bhatwachalila, ligongo kuhokoka kubhoka kwa Bhayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Nambo machobha gapakuhika, na ngocheni gabhile pambani, yakubhee bhandu bha kweli bhapakwachalila Annoongo kwa kutandaikwa na Mboomo na kweli. Ligongo bhandu handa abhaangota nga bhabhapala Atati bhanchalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Annoongo nga Mboomo na bhoa bhabhaachalila hipaalikwa kwaajopa mu Mboomo na kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mwikege jonijola akaajangula, “Niimanyi kubhee Amasiha atendakuhika, jwaakemwa Akilisito. Na jonojwe pabhapakuhika apakutukongolela maha kila chilebhe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nenga junongela na mwenga, nga jonojwe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Penapo bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakabhujanga, bhakakangachanga muno kwaabhona Ayesu abhikulongela na mwikege. Nambo jwakwa mundu jwaakonyite, “Mpala chiniki kwaachabhe?” Au “Kwa niki ntendakulongela nabho?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ngapena mwikege jonojwe akachileka chenichela chibhega penipala, akajaula kunnyini na kwalobholelanga bhandu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Nhikange mukannolange mundu jwaanobholile hikubho yoa hiindendite! Bholi, ngakomboleka jonojwe nga Akilisito?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bahi, bhandu bhajingi bhakabhokanga kubhoka kunnyini na kwaajendelela Ayesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Muda hogwe bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhatendita kwaapembelea Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, nlyee choachela.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Nambo Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Nenga ngweti chakulya mwangachimanya mwangota.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Bahi bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakajemekanga konyananga, “Bholi, abhi mundu jwaannetile chakulya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Chakulya changu nga chenjeni, kutenda genigala ga jwandumite na kujomola lihengo lyabhe. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mwangota nnobholanga, ‘Hiigalile mihei ncheche tuhunange, nambo nnyinulange miho nnolange migonda chigatekubhee tayali kwa kuhunwa.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Jwakuhuna atendakulepwa mbiya na atendakumba mahumo ligongo lya umomi gwa machobha goa ili jwaapanda na jwaahuna bhahangalilange pamo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Henela chilongelo chichilobhola. Jumo kupanda na jongi kuhuna. Nga bha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nenga nakantumanga nkahunange mu migonda mwangapandanga, bhangi bhakatendanga lihengo lya kulimba, nambo mwangota ntendakuchikonjanga ligongo lya lihengo lyabhenji.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Bhasamalia bhajingi kubhoka mu chilambo chenichela bhakanhobhalela Ayesu ligongo lya malobhe, “Atekunobholela hikubho yoa hiindendite.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Henela bhenibhala Bhasamalia bhakaajendelela Ayesu bhakaapembelea kutama nabho, akatama penapo machobha gabhele.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Bhandu bhajingi muno bhakahobhalelanga Ayesu ligongo lya malobhe gakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Bhakaalobholela haikege bhenibhala, “Ngocheni tutendakuhobhalela, ngabha kwa chenichela chinnongile mwenga tu, ligongo tutekwaajoa bhene, na tuimanyi kubhee abhabha nga kweli Mwokochi bha chilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakunnamia mwana jwa akolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Pagakajomoka machobha gabhele, Ayesu akabhoka penapo, akajaula ku chilambo cha Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwa kubhee Ayesu bhene akalongela kubhee, “Alondohi ngatopelwa mu chilambo chabhe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Bahi, pabhakahika ku chilambo cha Galilaya, Bhagalilaya bhakampokela. Ligongo na bhenaangota bhakibhanga bhatekuhibhonanga yoa hibhakatenda Ayesu konokwe ku Yelusalemu mu lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka, ligongo na bhenaangota bhakibha bhajaulinge mu lichobha likolongwa lyenelyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Henela Ayesu akahika kabhele konokwe ku chilambo cha Kana, chilambo cha ku Galilaya, kwakola kubhakagalambua machi kubhee divai. Penapo pakibha na akolo jumo kwaajibha na kakombo jwaakibha na ntamwa konokwe ku Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Akolo bhenabho pabhakajoa kubhee Ayesu abhokite ku chilambo cha Yudea na kuhika chilambo cha Galilaya, akaajendelela na kwaajopa ajaule kunnamia mwana jwabhe jwaakibha ntamwa kubhandikila na kujomoka. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Mwenga handa ngabhonanga hilolelo na yakangachika ng'o ngakombola kuhobhalela.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Anachilongola jonojwe akaalobholela, “Mwe mwakolo, choonde tujende tangu kakombo jwangu jwangajomoka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nnyaule tu, mwana jwinu atekulama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mundu jonojwe akahobhalela malobhe gabhakalobholelwa na Ayesu, akabhoka akajaula. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Pabhakibha tangu nndela, akakongana na bhatumichi bhabhe bhakaalobholela kubhee, “Kakombo jwinu alamite!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Bhakaakonyanga muda niki kakombo jwabhe pabhakalama, na bhenaangota bhakannobholela, “Licho muda gwa saa saba muhi, chitamwa chikaaleka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ngapena atati jwa jono kakombo akakombokela kubhee gukibha muda gogogo nga pabhakalobholelwa na Ayesu kubhee, “Kakombo jwinu alamite.” Henela akaahobhalela Ayesu bhenabho pamo na bhandu bhoa bha kwaachabhe.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Heche nga chikibha chilolelo cha bhele chibhakatenda Ayesu pabhatendita kubhoka ku chilambo cha Yudea na kujala Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakunnamia nangwabha Lichobha lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Pagakapeta genago, kukibha na lichobha likolongwa lya Bhayahudi, na bhena Ayesu akakwea kujaula ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Konokwe ku Yelusalemu, kubhandikila na nlyango gugukemwa Nlyango gwa Ngondolo, pakibha na litamanda lilikemwa kwa Chiebulania Betizata, litamanda helyo lilikatindilwa na hibhanja nhano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Monomwe mu lubhanja mukibha na akaatamwa bhajingi bhabhagonikwe, bhangalola, akanangwabha na bhabhapolite mmele, bhenabho bhabhikulendela machi gatitimbulikwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />kwakubhee muuda teno atumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo bhatendita kutuluka mmachi na kugatitimbua. Atamwa jwaakajemeka kujingila mmachi gagatitimbulikwe, atenda kulama chitamwa choachela chibhakibha nacho. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Bahi, penapo pakibha na mundu jumo jwakibha atamwa kwa yaaka chelachini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ayesu pabhakaabhona mundu jonojwe agolwike penapo kongo abhikumanya kubhee akibha atamwa kwa machobha gajingi, penapo akaakonya, “Bholi, mpala kulama?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ntamwa jonijola akannyangula, “Mwe Akolo, nenga nangali mundu bha kundumbukia mmachi gagatimbulilwe. Na nenga handa mbalite kutumbukila mu litamanda, mundu jongi kunongolela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Ayesu akaannobholela, “Nnyeme, ntole likai linu nnyende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Popopo mundu jonojwe akalama, akatola likai lyabhe, akajemeka kujenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Chikubho chenecho chikateendeka mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Henela akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakaalobholela mundu jonijola jwaalamite, “Leleni nga Lichobha lya Kupomolela, Malagilo gatendakanikia kutola likai linu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nambo mundu jonojwe akaajangulanga, “Jwajo mundu jwaatekunamia nga jwatekunobholela, ntole likai linu na nnyende.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bhakaankonya, “Nga aganiki jwaannobholile ntole likai linu na nnyende?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Nambo jonijola mundu jwaalamite jwangaamanya nga aganiki jwannamie, ligongo Ayesu akibha atekujaula na kuangalanika na bhandu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Kubhokela penapo, Ayesu akankolela jonijola mundu jwannamie pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kwalobholela, “Nnyoanikie ngocheni ntekulama. Nkotokutenda kabhele mabohu, handa nga henela chikoto kunkolela chikubho changalimmbone muno.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Jono mundu akajaula, akaalobholelanga hilongola ya Bhayahudi kubhee Ayesu nga jwakibha atekunnamia. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwakubhee akaalamia mundu mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela, Bhayahudi bhakajemekanga kwaahabhua Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Bahi, Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Atati bhangu atenda lihengo hata nangocheni, na nenga hela hela ndenda mahengo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Malobhe gangani gakaachimwanga hilongola ya Bhayahudi, henela bhakaloleanga kila ndela ja kupala kwaakoma Ayesu. Bhakatendanga henela ngabha kwa kuleka Malagilo ga Lichobha lya Kupomolela tu, ila hela hela kwa kwaakema Annoongo nga Atati jwabhe, kwa ngani hejo achitemba alandana na Annoongo.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolo gwa Mwana jwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, Mwana ngakombola kutenda chilebhe choachela jika jabhe, akombola kutenda chenichela chibhatenda Atati jwabhe. Kwa kubhee chenichela chibhatenda Atati jwabhe, Mwana atenda helahela. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Atati ampala Mwana na atenda kunnangia yoha hibhatenda bhena bhene. Ngapena apakunnangia hilebhe hikolongwa kupeta gangani, ili na mwangota mkapatange kukangachanga. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Handa henela Atati kwayoa bhabhawilinge na kwapeanga umomi, hele hela Mwana kwapekea umomi mundu jola jwampala. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Atati nganhukumula mundu joajola, nambo lihengo lyoa lya kuhumula annekile Mwana jwabhe, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ili bhandu bhoa bhantopee Mwana handa henela chibhantopea Atati. Mundu joajola jwangantopea Mwana, hela hela ngantopea Atati jwantumite.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, mundu joajola jwaajoa malobhe gangu na kwaahobhalela jonijola jwandumite, akweti umomi gwa machobha goa gwangapela. Na jonojwe ngahukumulikwa ng'o, nambo apakubhee apetite kubhoka kumalilo na kujingila mu umomi gwa machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, lichobha lipakuhika, nangocheni gahikite, bhabhawilinge pabhapakujoanga lilobhe lya Amwana bha Annoongo, na bhenaangota bhabhapakujoanga bhapakubhee bhamomi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Handa henela Atati chibhabhile ndando ja umomi, hela hela ampekie Mwana jwabhe kubhee ndando ja umomi nkati jabhe. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Bhena ampekie Mwana jwabhe ukolo gwa kuhukumula kwa kubhee bhenabho nga Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Nkotokangachanga kujoa gangani, kwa kubhee lichobha lipakuhikaa yakubhee bhenibhala bhabhawilinge bhapakujoanga lilobhe yabhe, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />bhenaangota bhapakubhokanga mumakabuli gabhenji. Bhenibhala bhabhatendinge gammbone bhapakuyokanga na kupata umomi, na bhenibhala bhabhatendite mabohu bhapakuyokanga na bhahukumulwe.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhabhalongela ngani ja Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Nenga ngakombola kutenda chikubho choachela kwa ukolo gwangu namwene. Nenga ndendakuhukumula handa chindendakujoa kubhoka kwa Annoongo, na kuhukumula kwangu kutendakondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo. Ligongo ngatenda handa chimbala namwene, ila ndenda chenichela chibhapala jwandumite.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Handa mbakuchikongolela nenga namwene, bahi malobhe gangu nga ga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Nambo abhi jongi jwaalongela ngani yangu, nenga niimanyi kubhee goa gabhalongela ligongo lyangu nga ga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwangota nkabhatumanga bhandu kwa Ayohana, na gabhatendakulongela nga ga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nambo nenga ngambala bhandu bhalongelange ngani jangu, nambo ndendakulongela gangani ili muokolewange. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Ayohana akibha handa lumuli lulujaka na kubhoha nhana, na mwangota nkaguhachukilanga nhana gwabhe kwa muuda nnyipijipi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Nambo nachikongolela namwene kupunda malobhe ga Ayohana. Mahengo gala ganagatenda, gakongolela ngani jangu, genigala yakubhee Atati andumite kugatenda, hilolelo yenjeni niitenda, hilangia kubhee Atati nga jwandumite. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Bhena Atati jwandumite alongela malobhe ga kweli nnani jangu. Na mwangota mwangalijoanga ng'o lilobhe lyabhe, wala kwaabhona chibhabhile, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na mwangota ngahobhalelanga genigala gabhalongela ligongo ngaahobhalela jonijola jwaantumite. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mwangota ntendakulolekea maha Majaandiko ga Annoongo mmikuganikianga kubhee nkati jabhe mpakupatanga umomi gwa machobha goha. Nambo Majandiko gangani nga gakongolela nenga! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Henela mwangota ngapalanga kuhika kwaachangu ili mpatange umomi gwa machobha goha.”<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nambo nenga ngapokela nng'anyimo kubhoka kwa bhandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Nambo ndendakummanyanga mwangota kubhee mwangali upaliho gwa Annoongo mu mitima jinunji. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nenga nhikite kwa lina lya Atati bhangu, na mwangota mwangambokelanga, nambo mundu jongi handa ahikite kwa ukolo gwabhe mwene, jonojwe mpakumpokelanga. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Bholi, mwangota nkombolangabholi kuhobhalela kongo mwangota ntenda kupekeana ng'anyimo mwangota kwa mwangota, na kongo ng'anyimo gugubhoka kwa Annoongo jika ngagupalanga? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Nambo nkotokuganikianga kubhee nenga mbakunnyochelanga nnongi ja Atati. Nambo Amusa junhobhalelanga nga jonojwe jwapakunnyochelanga. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Handa kweli nkaahobhalela Amusa, nkanhobhalile na nenga, kwa kubhee Amusa akajandika ngani yangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Nambo mwangota handa ngahobhalelanga genigala gabhajandike Amusa, mpakombolabholi kuhobhalela majigano gangu?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwapekea chakulya bhandu elupu nhano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Amatayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Amaluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Aluka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Pabhakajomola genago, Ayesu akajomboka litanda lya ku Galilaya, hela hela likemitwa litanda lya Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu gukaakagula, ligongo bhakaibhonanga hilolelo ya kwaalamianga akaatamwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Ngapena Ayesu akakwela kulitombi akatama pahi pamo na bhabhachijigananga bhabhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Lichobha likolongwa lya Bhayahudi lilikemwa Pasaka likibha libhandikile. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Bahi, Ayesu pabhakalola na kugubhona nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu gubhikunhikila, akankonya Afilipo, “Tupakuhemela koji mikate ili habha bhandu bhoa bhalyangange?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ayesu akakonya henela kwa kwalenga Afilipo, kwa kubhee mwene akalimanya chibhapakutenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Afilipo akaajangula, “Hata tukabhile na mbiya chekwa ngakombola kuhemela mikate kwa habha bhandu bhoa!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Jumo jwa bhabhachijigana bhabhe jwaakemwa Aandulea, anung'una bhabhe Asimoni Petulo, akaalobholela Ayesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Pambani abhile kakombo jumo jwaabhile na mikate nhano na homba hibhele hichoko hichoko. Bholi, hilebhe heye hipakutochanga kwa bhandu bhajingi handa bhambani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga bhabhajigana bhabhe, “Mwatamikange bhandu pahi.” Pakibha na manyai gajingi mahali penapo. Bahi, bhandu bhakatamanga pahi, pakibha na akanalome handa elupu nhano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ngapena Ayesu akaitola mikate jenijela, akaachukulu Annoongo na akaabhaganikianga bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakatamanga pahi. Hela hela akaajopelanga na yeniyela homba, kila mundu akapata handa chibhakapala. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bhandu bhoa pabhakalyenganga na kujukuta, Ayesu akaalobholelanga bhenibhala bhabhachijigananga bhabhe, “Nlokotange mbakatika, choachela chikotokuhobha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Henela bhakalokotanga na kutweleanga hijaluba komi na hibhele ya mbakatika ja mikate na homba hichoko hichoko hibhakahilekanga bhandu.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Bhandu pabhakabhonanga chilolelo chenecho chibhakatenda Ayesu, bhakajemekanga kulongela, “Kweli jonjoni nga Alondohi bha Annoongo jwaahika pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Ayesu pabhakahimanya kubhee bhandu bhapalanga bhaatende amwenye kwa machili, akabhoka kabhele, henela akakwela kabhele kulitombi jika jabhe.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakujenda nnani ja machi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Amatayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Amaluko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Lihobha palikatipika bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakatulukanga kujaula kulitanda, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />bhakakwelanga mu ntumbwi ili bhajombokange kujaula ku Kapelenaumu. Lubhendu lukajiingila na Ayesu akibha tangu angahikilanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Litanda likatitimbuka ligongo lya Mboongo ngolongwa gukapoga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bhabhachijigana bhabhe pabhakibha bhajaulinge kubhandikila maili tatu au ncheche, bhakaabhona Ayesu abhikujenda nnani ja machi, abhi kubhandikila na ntumbwi, bhabhajiagananga bhabhe bhakajogopanga muno. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Nambo Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nkotokujogopanga nga nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ngapena kwa kuhachuka bhakaabhandikia Ayesu mu ntumbwi, palapala bhakahikanga kumbwani kubhatendita kujaulanga.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhatendakwalolea Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Lichobha lilikahika, nkutuli gwa bhandu gugukahigalila upande gwa bhele gwa litanda bhakaimanyanga kubhee kukibha na ntumbwi gumo tu penipala, na Ayesu bhangakwela mu ntumbwi pamo na bhenibhala bhabhachijigana, ila bhabhachijigana bhenabho bhakibha bhajaulinge jikajabhenji. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Hikahika mitumbwi jengi kubhoka ku Tibelia kubhandikila na penipala pabhalilanga mikate, Hangwana pabhakajomola kwaachukulu Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Bahi, bhena bhandu pabhakaimanyanga kubhee Ayesu na bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakibhangahopo penapo, bhakwelanga muntumbwi, bhakajaulanga ku Kapelenaumu kwaalolea.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga chakulya chichileta umomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bhenibhala bhandu pabhakaabhona Ayesu abhi kuntundu ja bhele ja litanda bhakankonya, “Bhannyigana, nhikite lii pambani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Kweli ndendakunnobholenga, mwangota ngannoleanga kwa kubhee nkabhonanga hilolelo ila nga ligongo lya mukalyenganga mikate na nkajukutanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Nkotokuchiangakia chakulya chichibhola, nchiangaikie chakulya chichileta umomi gwa machobha goha. Chenecho nga chakulya chibhatekunpekea Mwana jwa Mundu ligongo Hangwana Annoongo atekunhagula.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ngapena bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, tutende chiniki ili tukoombole kugatenda genigala gabhagapala Annoongo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Heche nga chibhachipala Annoongo kwahobhalela jonijola jwantumite.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Henela bhakankonya, “Bholi mpakutenda hilolelo niki, ili tunhobhalele? Mpakutenda chilebhe niki? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Akanahota bhitu bhakalyenganga chakulya chikemitwa mana konikola palulemba, handa henela chiijandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, ‘Akaapekeanga chakulya chichibhokite kunani kwa Annoongo bhalyangange.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga ngabha Amusa jwaampekiinge chakulya kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo, ila nga Atati bhangu nga bhabhatekunpekeanga chakulya cha kweli kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwa kubhee chakulya cha Annoongo nga jonijola jwaatuluka kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo na kwaapekea umomi bhandu bha pachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bahi, bhakaalobholela, “Mwe mwa akolo, kujemekela ngocheni ntupekee chakulya hecho cha machobha goa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nenga nga chakulya gwa umomi. Jonijola jwaahobhalela nenga ngaakolela njala ng'o, na jonojwe jwaahobhalela nenga, ngabhona nyota ng'o. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Nambo handa chinitekunkongolelenga, hata handa ntekumonanga nambo tangu nganhobhalelanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Bhandu bhoa yakubhee Annoongo apakumbekea bhapakungagula nenga, na mundu joa jola jwapakuhika kwaachangu, ngammenga ng'o, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />kwa kubhee ndekutuluka kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo ngabha ligongo lya kutenda chenichela chimbala nenga, ila kutenda gabhagapala jonijola jwaandumite. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na hecheche nga chibhapala jonijola jwaandumite, kubhee ngotokwahobhea hata jumo pakati ja bhenibhala bhaatekumbekea, ila naayoange bhoa lichobha lya kupela. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwa maana chenjeni nga chibhachipala Atati bhangu, kila mundu jwaalola Mwana na kwahobhalela abhee na umomi gwa machobha goa, nanenga mbakwayoa mu lichobha lya kupela.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bahi, Bhayahudi bhakajemekanga kokolekanga kwa kubhee akalobhola, “Nenga nga chakulya chichitulwike kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bhakibhanga bhalobholanga, “Bholi, hojo ngabha Ayesu mwana jwa Ayosefu? Twamanyi atati bhabhe na anyongo bhabhe! Ngocheni akombolabholi kulongela kubhee atulwike kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Henela Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nnekange kokolekeana mwakaachinabhenenji. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Jwakwa mundu jwaakombola kuhika kwaachangu, handa ngahutwa na Atati jwaandumite, na nenga mbakwayoa lichobha lya kupela. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Akaalondohi bha Annoongo bhatekujandikanga, ‘Kila mundu jwaajoanikia na kuelewa chibhalongela Atati, na kuchijigana kubhoka kwaachabhe, jonojwe jwahika kwaachangu.’ <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Jwaakwa mundu jwaammonite Atati ila nga jonojwe jwakabhoka kwa Annoongo, jonojwe nga jika jabhe jwaammonite Atati. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, mundu joajola jwaahobhalela akweti umomi gwa machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nenga nga chakulya cha umomi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Akanahota bhinu bhakalyenganga chakulya chikemitwa mana kunikola palulemba, na bhakajomokanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Nambo pambani chibhile chakulya chichibhoka kunani kwa Annoongo na mundu joajola handa alile, ngajomoka. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nenga nga chakulya chichibhile chimomi chenichela chichibhokite kunani kwa Annoongo. Amundu bhoabhala handa bhalile chakulya chenjeni, apakutama machobha goa. Chakulya chimbakuchibhoa nga mmele gwangu ligongo lya umomi gwa bhandu bhoa bha pachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ngapena Bhayahudi bhakajemekanga kutaukana, “Mundu hojo akombolabholi kutupekea mmele gwabhe tulyee?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Kweli ndendakunlobholelanga, handa ngalyee mmele gwa Mwana jwa Mundu na kung'wee miyai jabhe, ngabhee na umomi nkati jinunji. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mundu joajola jwaalyee mmele gwangu na kung'wee miyai jangu akweti umomi gwa machobha goa, na nenga mbakwayoa lichobha lya kupela. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwa kubhee mmele gwangu nga chakulya cha kweli na miyai jangu nga chakung'wee cha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mudu joajola jwaalyee mmele gwangu na kung'wee miyai jangu, apakutama nkati jangu, na nenga mbakutama nkati jabhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Handa henela Atati jwabhile amomi chibhandumite, na nenga chindendakutama kupetela Atati, henela bhabhalye nenga apakutama kwa ndela jangu nenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Bahi, chenjeni nga chakulya chichitulwike kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo, ngabha handa chakulya chikemitwa mana chibhakalyenganga akanahota bhitu ngapena bhenaangota bhakajomokanga. Nambo mundu jwaalyee chakula heche apakutama machobha goa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ayesu akalongela genago pabhatenditakujigana mu nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi konikola ku Kapelenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe gagaleta umomi gwa machobha goa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Bhajingi bha bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhapakajoanga genago, bhakalobholanga, “Gangani nga majigano ga kulimba! Nga ganiki bhabhakombola kugapokela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Ayesu akaimanya kubhee bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhatendakokolekanga ngani ja majigano gabhe, akaalobholelanga, “Kwaniki majigano gangani gatendakunchimwanga? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Nangocheni ipakubheebholi, pampakummonanga Mwana jwa Mundu abhikubhuja kujaula kwakola kubhakibha kandai? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mboomo jwa Annoongo nga jwampekea mundu umomi, mmele ngakombola kutenda choachela. Malobhe gananlobholilinge nga Mboomo jwa Annoongo na jijileta umomi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Nambo bhabhilinge bhangi pakati jinunji tangu ngahobhalelanga.” Ayesu akalongela genago ligongo akaimanya kubhokela kandahi nga achiganiki bhangahobhalelanga, na akaimanya ganiki jwapakung'aluka nenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ngapena Ayesu akalobhola kabhele, “Nga kwa maana nakannobholelanga bhakwa bhabhakombola kuhika kwaachangu handa bhangajangatilwa na Atati bhangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ligongo lya genago, bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhakabhujanga bhakahengeleka ntima, na bhakalekanga kunkagula kabhele. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Bahi, Ayesu akaakonyanga bhabhachijigana bhabhe komi na bhabhele, “Bholi, na mwangota hela hela mpala kujaulanga?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Asimoni Petulo akaajangula, “Mwe Hangwana tupakujaula kwa ganiki? Mwenga nkweti malobhe gagaleta umomi gwa machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Nangocheni twenga tutendakuhobhalela, na tuimanyi kubhee mwenga nga jwajola juntumitwe na Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Ngapena Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Bholi, ngabha nenga bhananhagulinge mwangota komi na bhabhele? Nambo jumo jwinunji nga Lichetani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Ayesu atendita kulongela ngani ja Ayuda, mwana jwa Asimoni Isikalioti. Ayuda akibha jumo jwa bhabhachijigana bhabhe komi na bhabhele jonojwe nga jwapakwagaluka.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu ngahobhalelwa na akaanung'una bhabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Pabhakajomola genago, Ayesu akatenda mahengo mu maeneo gangi ga konokwe ku Galilaya. Jwangapala kujenda kuchilambo cha Yudea ligongo akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhapalita kunkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Lichobha likolongwa lya hilendo ya Bhayahudi jikibha jibhandikile maana gakwe kukombokela kuhamahama ku likonja. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Henela akaanung'una bhabhe Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Mmoke pambani nyauale ku Yudea ili bhenibhala bhabhachijgana bhinu bhabhonange yakangachika hintenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mundu jwaapala kumanyikana kwa bhandu ngatenda hikubho yabhe kwa kuchiiya. Handa mpakutenda hikubho heyo nchilangie mwabhene kwa bhandu bha chilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Kwa kubhee hata akaanung'una bhabhe bhangaahobhalela. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Bahi, Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Muuda gwangu gwammbone tangu gwangahika, nambo kwaachinu mwenga kila muda nga gwammbone. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Bhandu bha chilambo ngakombola kunchimwanga mwangota, nambo bhatendakunjimwanga nenga ligongo ndenda kulangia genigala gabohu. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mwangota nnyaulange mu lichobha likolongwa lyenelyo. Nenga ngajaula ligongo muda gwangu tangu gwangahika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Pabhakalongela henela akahigalila ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu mu lichobha likolongwa ya hilendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Nambo akaanung'una bhabhe pabhakajaulanga mu Lichobha likolongwa helyo, na jono Ayesu akajaula, jwangajenda kwa kuchilangia nambo akajaula kwa chitikita. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Akaachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakibhanga bhakibhalolea Ayesu mu lichobha likolongwa lyenelyo, bhakakonya, “Bholi, mundu jola abhi koji?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kukibha na nong'omi nong'omi hijingi mu nkutuli gwa bhandu ya ngani ja Ayesu. Pakati jabhenji bhakalobholanga, “Nga mundu jwammbone.” Bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Ngabha! Atendakwatembanga bhandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Nambo jwakwa mundu joajola jwaakalenga kulongela ngani ja Ayesu palundwanje ligongo bhakibhanga bhatenda kujogopanga akachilongola bha Bhayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Lichobha likolongwa lyenelyo palikabhee pakati, Ayesu akakwela kujaula pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kujemeka kujigana. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Bahi, akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakakangachanga bhakakonyaga, “Bholi, mundu hojo agapatite koji majigano haga na jonojwe jwangachijigana kohakola?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Majigano ganyigana ngabha gangu, ila nga ga jonijola jwaandumite. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mundu jwaapala kutenda genigala gabhapala Annoongo, apakuimanya kubhee majigano gangu gabhoka kwa Annoongo, au nenga ndenda kugalongela gangu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mundu jwaalongela mweene alolea ng'anyimo gwabhe mweene nambo mundu jonijola jwaalolea ng'anyimo gwa jonijola jwaandumite nga bha kweli, wala gwakwa unami goagola nkati jabhe. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Bholi, Amusa bhangampekeanga Malagilo? Nambo pakati jinunji jwakwa hata jumo jwaakamwile Malagilo genago. Kwa niki mpalanga kungoma?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Gonigola ntukuli gwa bhandu gukaajangula, “Mwenga nkweti lihoka! Nga ganiki jwaapala kunkoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Ndendite chilolelo chimo, mwangota mwabhoa nkakangachanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Amusa akanlagianga mwahinange bhana bhinunji, hata handa ngabha Amusa ila akanahota bhinunji nga bhabhakajemekanga chiiyobhalilike kuhina. Na mwangota mwahinanga bhana bhinu hata kwa Lichobha lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Handa mwana akombola kuhinwa mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela ili kukamula Malagilo ga Amusa, kwa niki ntendakutumbala kwa kunlamia mundu Lichobha lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Nkoto kuhukumula mundu kwa kunnola tu, nambo nhukumulange ligongo lya kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bholi, hojo nga Akilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bhandu teno bha ku Yelusalemu bhatenditakulongelanga, “Bholi, hojo mundu nga jonijola jwaabhaalolea bhankome? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Abhi pambani, atendakulongela palundwanje nnoongi ja bhandu bhoa, na wala ngaalobholela chilebhe choachela. Komboleka akaachilongola bhatendakuhimanya kubhee hojo nga Akilisito. <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Nambo kubhabhoka mundu hojo twenga tukumanyi, nambo Akilisito pabhapakuhika jwakwa mundu jwaapakumanya kubhabhokite!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ngapena Ayesu akapunda kujigana pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, abhikulobhola, “Mwangota mutendakunimanya na mukumanyi kumooka! Nenga ngahika ligongo lyangu mwene, ila jonojwe jwaandumite nga bha kweli, mwangota ngammanyanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Nambo nenga naamanyi ligongo mokite kwaachabhe, na jonojwe nga jwaandumite.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ngapena bhandu bhapalitanga kunkamula, nambo jwakwa mundu joajola jwaakalenga kunyulula lubhoko lwabhe kunkamula ligongo muda gwabhe gukibha tangu kuhika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Bhandu bhajingi kubhoka mu gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu bhakanhobhalela, atendita kulongela, “Bholi, Akilisito pabhapakuhika, apakutenda hilolelo hikolongwa muno kupunda hiyaatenite hojo mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaalendei bhatendakutumwanga kwaakamula Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo bhakajoanga bhandu bhabhikunong'onanga ngani ja Ayesu. Bahi, bhenaangota pamo na akaakolo bha akaakung'i bhakaatumanga akaalendei bhajaulange kunkamula. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nenga tangu nibhii na mwangota kwa machobha kachoko, ngapena mbakubhuja kwaachabhe jonijola jwaandumite. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mpakunoleanga nambo ngamona, na penipala pambakubhee mwangota ngakombolanga kuhika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Akaachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakalobholelana akaachinabhene, “Hojo mundu apala kujaula koji mpaka tukotokwabhona? Bholi, apala kujaula kwa Bhagiliki konikola bhandu bhitu kubhapwilinganike, na kwaajigananga Bhagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ngocheni pabhalongela henela maana jakwe niki, mpakunoleanga nambo ngamonanga na konokwe kumbakubhee mwangota ngakombolanga kuhika'?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheembwe cha machi ga umomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Lichobha lyenilyela lya kupela lya Lichobha Likolongwa, Ayesu akajema na akalongela kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Mundu joajola jwabhi na nyota haike kwaachangu ang'wee. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Mundu joajola jwanhobhalela nenga, handa Majaandiko ga Annoongo chigalobhola, ‘Cheembwe cha machi ga umomi gatendakuchuka kubhoka mu ntima gwabhe.’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ayesu atenditakulongela ngani ja Mboomo ja Annoongo yakubhee bhapakwaapokela bhenibhala bhandu bhabhaahobhalela. Muda gonogwe Mboomo jwa Annoongo akibha tangu kuhika ligongo Ayesu akibha tangu jwangayoka na kutukuchwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupwilinganika kwa bhandu bha Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bhandu bhangi pakati ja gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu, bhakajoanga ngani jenejo, bhakalobholanga, “Kweli hojo mundu nga alondohi bha Annoongo!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Hojo nga Akilisito!” Nambo bhandu bhangi bhakachikonyanga, “Bholi, komboleka Akilisito kwaachabhe nga ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Bholi, Majaandiko ga Annoongo gangalobhola kubhee Akilisito apakupitila kuchilagwa cha Adaudi na apakubhoka ku Betelehemu chilambo chibhakatama Adaudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Henela bhandu bhakametunikanga ligongo lyabhe. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bhandu kachoko bhakapalanga kwaakamula nambo jwakwa mundu jwakanyulula lubhoko kwaakamula.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakananga kwaahobhalela Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ngapena bhenibhala akaalendei bhabhakatumwanga bhakabhujanga kwa akaakolongwa bha akaakung'i na Mafalisayo, bhenaangota bhakaakonyanga, “Kwa niki mwangankamula?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Bhenibhala akaalendei bhakajangulanga, “Jwakwa mundu jwaakombwile kulongela handa chibhalongela mundu hojo!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi, na mwangota hela hela ntekutembwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Bholi, mwamanyi nkolo au Amfalisayo joajola jwaahobhalile? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Nambo nkutuli hogo gwa bhandu gukanhobhalela kongo bhabhingamanya Malagilo ga Amusa, kubhee bhatakullaniwa na Annoongo!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Anikodemo akibha jumo jwa bhenaangota akachilongola jwaakajendela Ayesu lichobha limo kilo. Akaakonyanga akaajabhe, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Bholi, Malagilo gitu gatendakuhukumula mundu tangu ja kwaajoa oti na kumanya atendite chiniki?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bhakanyangula, “Bholi, na mwenga hela hela mmokite ku Galilaya? Mugachome maha Majaandiko ga Annoongo na nchijigane jwakwa alondohi jwa Annoongo jwabhokela ku Galilaya!”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Bahi, kila jumo akabhuja kwaachabhe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwikege jwaakamulikwe abhikutenda ngoongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Nambo Ayesu akajenda ku litombi lya Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Malabhi jakwe kundabhi Ayesu akaika kabhele pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Bhandu bhoha bhakaatindila, na jonojwe akatama pahi kujemeka kwaajigananga. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bhabhajigana bha Malagilo na Mafalisayo bhakaaletela mwikege jumo jwaakamulikwe abhi kutenda ngongola bhakannyemea mwikege jonojwe nnongi ja bhandu bhoa. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, hojo mwikege atekamulikwa abhikutenda ngoongola. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mu Malagilo Amusa bhakatulagia apotwe maganga mwikege handa hojo, mpaka ajomoke. Nangocheni mwenga nkitabholi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bhakakonya henela handa ntaambo bhapatange ndela ja kwaatakia. Nambo Ayesu akakotima, akajandika paundopi kwa lukonji lwabhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pabhakapundanga kwaakonya, Ayesu akajinuka akaalobholelanga mundu joajola jwangalemwa alongolele kwampota liganga. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ayesu akakotima kabhele na kujaandika pahi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Bhandu bhala pabhakajohanga henela, bhakajemekanga kubhokanga jumo jumo, kujemekela akanaota. Ayesu akaigalila jikajabhe na jonijola mwikege abhi ajemite nnongi jabhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ayesu akajimuka na kwaakonya jonijola mwikege, “Mwa amama, bhabhi koji bhandu bhabhakankamula, bholi, jwakwa mundu joajola jwatekunhukumula?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Jonijola mwikege akaajangula, “Mwe mwa akolo jwakwa mundu jwatekuhukumula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Ayesu akaalobholela, “Maha na nenga kabhele nganhukumula. Nyaule kwachinu nkotokutenda kabhele mabohu kabhele.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga nhana gwa bhandu pachilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ngapena Ayesu akalobholela kabhele Mafalisayo, “Nenga nga nhana gwa bhandu pachilambo. Mundu joajola jwangagula nenga ngajenda mulubhendu ng'o, nambo apakubhee na nhana gwa umomi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafalisayo bhakaalobholela, “Mwenga nchikongolela mwabhene malobhe ga kweli, henela malobhe ginu nga ga kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Hata handa ndendakuchilongolela namwene, kuchikongolela kwangu nga kwa kweli ligongo nenga nikumanyi kumookite na kunyaula. Nambo mwangota ngakumanya kumookite wala kunyaula. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mwangota ntendakuhukumula handa bhandu chibhanhukumulanga, nambo nenga nganhukumula mundu joajola. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Hata handa mbakuhukumula, kuhukumula kwangu nga kwa kweli ligongo nenga ngahukumula jika jangu, bali ndendakuhukumula na Atati jwandumite. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Jijandikwe mu malagilo ginunji yakubhehe, gabhalongela bhandu bhabhele gatendakondekwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nenga ndendakuchilongolela namwene, na jono Atati jwaandumite, atendakulongelea nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ngapena bhakaakonya, “Atati bhinu abhi koji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Mwangota ngamanya nenga wala ngaamanya Atati bhangu. Handa nkamanyite nenga, hela hela nkaamanyite Atati bhangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ayesu akalongela gangani pabhakibha atendakujigana pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo kubhandikila na chanduku lya kubhekela chalaka. Nambo jwakwa mundu jwaankamwile ligongo muuda gwabhe gukibha tangu kuhika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyaula nenga mwangota ngakombola kuhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Ayesu akalobholelanga kabhele, “Nenga ndendakujaula, na mwangota mpakunoleanga, nambo mpakujomokanga mu mabohu ginunji. Kunyaula nenga mwangota ngakombola kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ngapena akanachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakakonyananga, “Bholi, apakuchikoma mwene? Bholi, nga ligongo alobhola henela, ‘Kunyaula nenga mwangota ngakombola kuhika?’”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Mwangota mmokanga mu chilambo heche, nambo nenga moka kunani kwa Annoongo. Mwangota nga bhandu bha pachilambo heche, nambo nenga ngabha mundu chilambo heche. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Nga kwa maana nakannobholelanga kubhee mpakujomokanga mu mabohu ginunji. Handa ngahobhalelanga ya kubhee, ‘Nenga nga jonojwe,’ mpakujomokanga mu mabohu ginunji.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bhakaakonya, “Mwenga nga aganiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Nenga nga jwajola junakannobolelanga kubhokela kandai. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ngweti hikubho hijingi ga kunnongela na kunhukumulanga mwangota. Nambo jonojwe jwaandumite nga bha kweli, na nenga ndendakunnobholelanga bhandu bha pachilambo ganagajoine kubhoka kwaachabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Bhangaimanyanga kubhehe Ayesu akibha atenditakulongelanabho ngani ja Atati. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Pampakwanyakula Mwana jwa Mundu pankongo, ngapena pampakumanyanga kubhee, ‘Nenga nga jwajola,’ na kubhee ngatenda choachela kwa ukolo gwangu, ila nongela genigala gabhakanagia Atati nongele. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Jonijola jwaandumite abhi pamo na nenga, jonojwe jwanganeka jika jangu machobha goa ndenda genigala gagaabhajila.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Bhandu bhajingi bhabhanyoanikia Ayesu abhikulongela malobhe gangani bhakanhobhalela.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kweli jipakuntenda kulekelelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga bhenibhala Bhayahudi bhabhakahobhalela, “Handa nkamwilinge majigano gangu, mwangota mpakubhee bhabhachiganga bhangu bha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ngapena mpakuimanyanga kweli na jene kweli jipakuntenda kulekelelwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bhenaangota bhakaajangula, “Twenga nga ubhelehi gwa Aibulahimu, na twenga twangabhehe akaabhanda bha mundu joajola. Nkombolabholi kulobhola yakubhee twenga tupakulekelwa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, mundu joajola jwaatenda mabohu nga mmanda jwa mabohu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mmanda ngatama machobha goa kaja, nambo mwana atama kaja machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mwana handa atendite kulekelwa, mpakulekelwanga kweli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndenda kuimanya yakubhee mwangota nga ubhelehi gwa Aibulahimu. Nambo mwangota mpalanga kungoma ligongo malobhe gangu ngatamanga mu mitima jinunji. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nenga ndendakunnobholelanga genigala ganagabhonite panakibha Atati, na mwangota hela hela ntendanga genigala gamugajoine kubhoka kwa atati bhinu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bhakaajangulanga, “Twenga atati bhitu nga Aibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Handa mwangota nkabhilinge bhana bha Aibulahimu, nkatenditinge handa genigala gabhatendite atati bhinu Aibulahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nambo nangocheni mwangota mpalanga kungoma, mundu yakubhee jundekunnobholelanga kweli genigala gandekujoa kubhoka kwa Annoongo. Aibulahimu jwangatenda chikubho handa chenjeni! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwangota ntendanga hikubho hibhatenda atati bhinu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Bhakaajangula, “Twenga twangabhelekwa kwa kutenda ngongola, tukweti Atati bhamo, yakubhee Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Handa Annoongo akabhile Atati bhinu, nkambalite nenga, kwakubhee nakabhoka kwa Annoongo na ngocheni mmi pambani. Nangaika kwa ukolo gwangu mwene, ila kwa ukolo gwa jonojowe jwaandumite. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Kwa niki ngaelewanga gandendakulongelanga? Ligongo mwangali uwecho gwa kugakamula majigano gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mwangota nga bhana bha Abohu, mwangota ntendakagulanga chibhalokolila atati bhinunji. Jonojwe akibha akomi kubhokela kandai, na ngakombola kujemelela ukweli ligongo nkati jabhe gakwa ukweli. Pabhalobhola unami alobhola handa chibhayobhalile ligongo nga anami na nga atati bha unami. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kwa kubhee panongela ukweli, na mwangota ngahobhalelanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nga ganiki nkati jinunji jwakombola kulangia kubhee nenga ngweti mabohu? Handa ndendakunnobholelanga gagabhi kweli, kwa niki nganhobhalelanga? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Joajola jwabhoka kwa Annoongo kugajohanikia malobhe ga Annoongo. Nambo mwangota ngajohanikianga ligongo ngabhoka kwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu akibha tangu ja Aibulahimu kubhelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Akachilongola Bhayahudi bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, twangalongela kweli kubhee mwenga nga bha Nsamalia na nkweti lihoka?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Nenga nanga lihoka, nambo nenga ndendakwatopea Atati bhangu, nambo mwangota ngandopeanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nenga ngalolea ukolo gwangu namwene, nambo abhile jumo jwaalolea ukolo gonogwe, jonojwe nga aliwali. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, mundu joajola handa akamwile majigano gangu jonojwe ngajomoka machobha goa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ngapena Bhayahudi bhakaalobholela, “Nangocheni tuimanyi kubhee mwenga nkweti lihoka. Aibulahamu akajomoka na hela hela akaalondohi bha Annoongo bhakajomokanga, nambo mwenga nnobhola, mundu joajola handa akamwile majigano ginu ngajomoka machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Bholi, mwenga nga mwakolongwa kupunda atati bhitu Aibulahimu? Jonojwe akajomoka na hela hela akalondohi bha Annoongo bhakajomokanga. Bholi, mwenga ng'anikia kubhee nga aganiki?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Handa kuching'anyima namwene, ukolo gwangu ngabha chilebhe. Atati bhangu nga jwang'anyima nenga yakubhee mwangota nnolobhola kubhee Annoongo bhinu, nga jwang'anyima nenga. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Mwangota ngaamanya, nambo nenga ndendakummanyanga. Handa nongile ngaamanya, mbakubhee anami handa mwangota. Nambo nenga naamanyi na kutenda chibhapala. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Atati bhinu Aibulahimu, akahachukula abhone lichobha lyangu, jonojwe akalibhona na kuliachukila.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bhayahudi bhakaakonya, “Bholi, mwenga mwangahika hata yaka hamsini, nkombolabholi kulongela mwabhonite Aibulahimu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Kweli ndendakunnobholela, tangu Abulahimu jwangabhe, ‘Nenga nakibha.’”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ngapena bhakalokotanga maganga ili bhampote, nambo Ayesu akachiiya, akatelenya pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu annamia mundu jwaabhelikwe ngalola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Lichobha limo Ayesu pabhatendita kupeta, akammona mundu jwangalola kubhokela chibhelekwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Bhabhachigana bhabhe bhakaakonya, “Bhannyigana, nga ganiki jwatendite mabohu mpaka hojo mundu kubhelekwa ngalola, bholi jwatendite mabohu nga hojo mundu au akaabhelei bhabhe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Ayesu akajangula, “Ngabha jonjoni wala akaabhelei bhabhe bhabhatenditinge mabohu. Akabhelekwa henela ili ukolo gwa Annoongo gabhonekane mu umomi gwabhe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tupalikwa kutendeka mahengo gakwe jonojwe jwandumite kukibha tangu muhi. Lubhendu lutendakuika na jwakwa mundu jwaapakombola kutenda lihengo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Mmi tangu pachilambo, nenga nga nhana gwa bhandu bha pachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulongela genago, akauna mata pahi, akaalakia mandope kwa mata genigala na kwantyeka jwangalola jonijola mmiho. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ngapena akalobholela, “Nnyaule nkakuhe mu litanda lya Siloamu.” Siloamu maana gakwe nga jonijola jwatumitwe. Ngapena jonijola jwangalola akajaula, kuha machi, na akabhuja abhikulola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Akaandami ajabhe na bhandu pabhakaabhona abhi kujopajopa bhakachikonyanga, “Bholi, mundu hojo nga jonijola jwatendita kujopajopa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Jonjoni nga jonojwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Bhangi bhakalobhola, “Ngabha jonojwe atekulandana tu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Nambo mwene akalobhola, “Nenga nga jonijola jundendita kujopajopa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bahi, bhakibha bhatendakwakonya, “Bholi, nangocheni miho ginu gakombwilebholi kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Jonojwe akajangula, “Jwajola mundu jwakemwa Ayesu jwakaalakia mandope, akandipaha mmiho jangu akanobholela. Nyaule mu litanda lya Siloamu. Ngakue na popopo ngakombola kulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bhakaakonya, “Mundu jonojwe abhi koji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Akaajangulanga, “nenga ngamanya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo bhatendakulolekea maha jwangalola alamikwebholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ngapena bhakaapeleka kwa Mafalisayo jonijola mundu jwakibha ngalola kubhokela pena kandai. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Lichobha helyo Ayesu pabhaalakia undopi na kugalamia miho ga jonijo mundu likibha Lichobha lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Pena Mafalisayo bhakaakonya kabhele jono mundu chibhatekombola kulola. Jonojwe akaalobholelanga, “Akandipaa mandope mmiho jangu, ngakuha na ngocheni ndendakulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo bhangi bhakalobhola, “Hojo mundu ngabhoka kwa Annoongo, ligongo ngakamula Malagilo ga Lichobha lya Kupomolela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Nambo bhandu bhangi bhakakonya, “Mundu jwaakweti mabohu akombolabholi kutenda hilolelo handa yenjeni.” Henela bhakametunikanga. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Henela Mafalisayo akaakonya kabhele jonijola mundu, “Mwenga nga junnamikwe miho, nkombolabholi kwaakongolela mundu jonojwe?” Ligongo miho ginu galamite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Jonojwe akaajangulanga, “Jonojwe nga alondohi bha Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhangahobhalelanga kubhehe mundu hojwe akibha ngalola ngocheni atendakulola, mpaka pabhakaakema akaabhelei bhabhe. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bhaakonyanga akaabhelei bhabhe, “Bholi, hojo nga mwana jwinunji, jwaakibha ngalola kubhoka chibhelekwa? Ngocheni atekombolabholi kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Akaabhelei bhabhe bhakajangulanga, “Tuimanyi kubhee hojo nga mwana jwitu, na tuimanyi abhelikwe ngalola. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Nambo twenga ngaimanya akombwilebholi kulola, wala ngammanya jwannamie miho. Mukonyange mwene jono nga nkolongwa na atendakumanya kuchikongolela mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Akaabhelei bhabhe bhakalongelanga henela ligongo bhatendita kwajogopanga akaakolo bha Bhayahudi, ligongo Bhayahudi bhakalobholanga mundu joajola jwatendakwakonda Akilisito apakuhibhilwa kuchalila mu nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Henela akaabhelei bhabhe bhakalobholanga, “Jono mundu nga nkolongwa, mukonyange mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bahi, bhakaakema kabhele jonijola jwakibha ngalola, bhakaalobholela, “Mwapekee Annoongo ukolo gwabhe! Twenga tuimanyi kubhehe mundu hojo jwannamie atekola mabohu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Mundu jonojwe akaajangulanga, “Handa mundu jonojwe atekola mabohu au jwanga mabohu nenga ngaimanya. Nambo chikubho chimo chinichimanya, ngibha ngalola nangocheni ndendakulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bhakaakonya, “Akantendela chiniki? Atekunnamiabholi miho ginu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Jono mundu akaajangulanga, “Nyomwile kunnobholelanga, mwangota ngapalanga kunyonikiha. Kwa niki mpalanga kujoanikia kabhele? Bholi, mwangota hela hela mpalanga kubhehe bhabhachijigana bhakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ngapena bhakaatukana na kwalobholela, “Mwenga nga bhanchigana bha mundu jonojwe, twenga nga bhabhachijigana bha Amusa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Twenga tutendakuimanya kubhee Annoongo akalongela na Amusa, nambo hojo mundu ngakumanya kwaapitila.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Jonijola mundu akaajangulanga, “Mbwito ndendakunkangachanga! Ngaimanya kwaabhoka, na jonojwe atekunamia miho gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tuimanyi yakubhehe Annoongo ngaajonikia mundu joajola jwatekola mabohu, nambo kunnyoanikia mundu jonijola jwankonda na kutenda genigala gabhagapala. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kubhokela kuhalakikwa kwa chilambo, jwangajoanika kubhee abhi mundu jwannamie mundu jwabhelikwe jwangalola na jonojwe akalola. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Handa jono mundu jwangabhoka kwa Annoongo, akakombwilehopo kutenda choachela.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bhakaajangula, “Mwenga mmelikwe nkibha mmi na mabohu, nkombolabholi kutujigana twenga?” Henela bhakammenga apite panja ja nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo bhatendakulepelanga kugumanya ukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ayesu pabhakajoha kubhehe jonijola mundu bhatekummenganga panja ja nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi, akaakonya, “Bholi, mwenga ntendakunhobhalela Mwana jwa Mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Jonijola mundu akajangula, “Mwe mwa akolo jono mundu nga ganiki? Nnobholele nahobhalele.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Ntekwabhona, na hojo junnongelanabho, nga jonojwe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Jonijo mundu akalobhola, “Mwe Hangwana, ndendakuhobhalela ngapena akatindibhala majugwa na kwachalila.”<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Ayesu akalobhola, “Ndekuika pachilambo pani ligongo lya kuhukumula, ili bhenibhala bhangalola bhapatange kulola, na bhabhalola bhakotokulolanga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo bhangi pabhakibhanga pamo na Ayesu pabhakajoanga alongela henela bhakaakonya, “Bholi, alongela hela hela na twenga ngalola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Handa nkabhilinge ngalolanga, nkalimwitingehopo, nambo kwa kubhee nnongelanga. Twenga tutendakulolanga tangu ntendanga mabohu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia kwa anchungaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Kweli ndendakunlobholelanga, mundu joajola jwangajingila mu lichinga kupetela ndela ja nniango, nambo akwela kujingila nkati kwa ndela jengi, hojo nga abwihi na apoki. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Mundu jwaajingila kwa kupetela panniango jonojwe nga achungaji bha ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Ajemelei jwa nniango atendakwajogolela na ngondolo kulijoa lilobhe lyabhe, na atenda kuikema ngondolo kwa mahina gabhenji na kwapianga panja. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Handa ajomwile kwapianga bhoha panja, atendakulongolela nnongi jabhenji na ngondolo hitendakagula ligongo bhatendakulimanya lilobhe lyabhe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Nambo ngondolo ngaakagula hageni, bali bhapakummutuka, kwa ligongo ngamanyanga lilobhe lya hageni.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga kulandanikia hokoko, nambo bhenaangota bhangaelewanga genago gabhatendita kwalobholelanga.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga anchungaji bhammbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ngapena, Ayesu bhakalobhola nabho kabhele akaalobholelanga, “Kweli ndendakunlobholelanga, nenga nga nniango gwa ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bhoha bhabhalongolilinge nga akabwihi na akaapoki, nambo ngondolo bhangaajoanikianga. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nenga nga nniango. Mundu joajola jwapakujingila mu lichinga kwa kupetela kwachangu apakuokolewa, apakujingila na kubhoka, na kujaula mahali pakulyee. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Abwihi kuhika ili kujibha, kukoma na kualabiana. Nenga nakahika ili mmangange na umomi gwa machobha goa, ngapena bhabhenago tuumbe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Nenga nianchungaji bhammbone. Anchungaji bhammbone kubhoa umomi gwabhe ligongo lya ngondolo yabhe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mundu jwaalia ngondolo kwa kulepwa ngabha akola ngondolo, pabhammona limehi atendakuika, kwalekanga ngondolo na kubhutuka, ngapena mamehi kuikamula na kuipwilingania. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Mundu jonojwe apakubhutuka ligongo jonojwe nga mundu jwa kulepwa ngaajali ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nenga nga anchungaji bhammbone. Ndendakwamanya ngondolo yangu na ngondolo yangu hitendakumanya, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />handa henela Atati chibhatendakumanya nenga, na nenga chindendakwamanya Atati, na nenga mii tayali kujomoka ligongo lya ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ngweti ngondolo yengi yakubhee ngabha bha hele lichinga, au hela hela mbalikwa kwaletanga pamile. Na bhenaangota bhapakulimanya lilobhe lyangu, henela papakubhee na lilubhalo limo na anchungaji jumo.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Chibhambalila Atati nga kugubhoa umomi gwangu ngapena nigupokele kabhele. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Jwaakwa mundu jwagubhoa umomi gwangu, nenga ndendakugubhoa kwa kupala namwene. Ndendakombola kugubhoa umomi gwangu na ndendakombola kugubhujia kabhele. Henela nga chibhatekungulumikia Atati ndende.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Bhayahudi pabhakajoanga malobhe genago ga Ayesu bhametunikange. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bhangi pakati jabhenji bhakalobholanga, “Hojo akweti lihoka, kabhele nga mpangai! Kwa niki ntendakwajonikia?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Mundu jwatekola lihoka ngakombola kulongela handa henela. Bholi, lihoka litendakombola kunnamia miho ya mundu jwangalola?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakanikwa na Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Konokwe ku Yelusalemu kukibha na lichobha likolongwa lya kubhekwa kabhele Nyuumba ja Annoongo chwaapi ligongo lya kondekwa kwaachalila Hangwana, na machobha genago gakibha machobha ga malili. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Ayesu atendita kujenda nkati ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo palubhanja lwa Asolomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Lilubhalo lya Bhayahudi bhakaantindila na kwaakonya, “Mpakutubheka mu maganikilo mpaka lii? Ntukongolele pandaa handa mwenga nga Akilisito.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Ngankongolelanga, nambo ngahobhalelanga. Mahengo ganagatenda nenga kwa ukolo gwa Atati bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Nambo nganhobhalela, ligongo mwangota ngabha ngondolo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Handa henala ngondolo chibhajoanga lilobhe lya anchungaji bhabhenji, bhandu bhangu bhatendakuchimanya chinnongela ndendakwamanyanga na bhatekubhee bhabhachijigana bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nenga ndendakumpekeanga umomi gwa machobha goa, na bhenaangota ng'o ngalekana na Annoongo, na jwakwa mundu jwapakombola kwabhoanga mmabhoko gangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Atati bhangu jwambekie habha nga nkolongwa kupeta bhoha na jwakwa mundu jwakombola kwaapokonyola mmabhoko gabhe. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nenga na Atati bhangu nga chilebhe chimo.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Henela, Bhayahudi bhakalokotanga kabhele maganga ili kwaapota Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Ndekunnangianga hilolelo hijingi hiibhokite kwa Atati. Ligongo lya hilolelo niki pakati ya yeneyo hiipakuntendanga mbotange maganga?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakaajangula, “Ngampota maganga ngabha kwa ligongo lya lihengo linu lyammbone, ila nga ligongo lya kwaaponja Annoongo. Mwenga nga mundu nchitemba kubhee handa Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Bholi, jangajandikwa mu Majandiko ga Annoongo, ‘Mwangota minoongo?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Handa bhenibhala bhabhatekwaapekea lilobhe lyabhe akalobhola bhatekulandana na jonojwe, nga henela Majandiko ga Annoongo nga ga ukweli machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Bholi, nkombolabholi kwaalobholela atenda kutukana jonijola Atati jwaatekwabhoa Atati kwa lihengo lyabhe na kwaatuma pachilambo ligongo ndekulobhola, ‘Nenga nga Mwana jwa Annoongo?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Handa ngatenda mahengo ga Atati, bahi nkotokunhobhalela. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Nambo handa ndendakutenda mahengo ga Annoongo, hata handa ngapalanga kuhobhalelanga nenga nhobhalelange mahengo genago, ili muhimanyange kubhee Atati abhile nkati jangu, na nenga mile nkati jabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ngapena bhakajiganga kwaakamula kabhele Ayesu, nambo akapokonyoka mmabhoko gabhenji.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ayesu akajaula kabhele kutundu ja loochi Yolodani mahali penipala pabhatendita Ayohana kubaticha bhandu, jonojwe akatama konokwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bhandu bhajingi bhakaajaulila Ayesu, na bhenaangota bhakalobholanga, “Ayohana jwangatenda chilolelo choachela, nambo kila chilebhe chibhalongile Ayohana nnani ja hojo nga cha kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Bhandu bhajingi konokwe bhakaahobhalela Ayesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kujomoka kwa Alazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Pakibha na mundu jumo jwa ku Betania jwakemitwa Alazalo akibha ntamwa. Akaalombo bhahe bhakibhanga bhakemitwa Amalia na Amalata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Amalia hojo, nga jonijola jwakaapakala Hangwana mahuta gakunungila na kwaahunguta Alazalo makongono kwa majunju gakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Henela akaalombo bhabhe Alazalo bhakaatumila Ayesu ngani kwaalobholela, “Mwe Hangwana, aganja bhinu jwamumpala nga ntamwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ayesu pabhakajoha genago, akalobhola, “Alazalo ngajomoka kwa chitamwa heche, ila gupakulangia ng'anyimo gwa Annoongo, ili Mwana jwa Annoongo akombole kutopelwa kupetela heche chitamwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Ayesu na Amalata na Amalia na Alazalo bhakibhanga na uganja nkolongwa muno. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ayesu pabhakajoa kubhee Alazalo atendakulwala, akajonjokea kutama mahali penapo kwa machobha gabhele. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Bahi, pagakapeta machobha genago Ayesu akaalobholelanga bhabhachijigana bhabhe, “Nangocheni tubhujange kabhele ku Yudea.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakaalobholela, “Bhannyigana, akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhapalita kunkoma kwa kumpota maganga, kwa niki mpala kubhuja kabhele konokwe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Bholi, muhi gwangali masaa komi na gabhele? Bahi, bhandu handa ajendite muhi ngakombola kobhanduka kwakubhee atendakugubhona nhana gwa heche chilambo. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nambo bhandu handa bhajendite kilo bhapakubhanduka ligongo bhangali nhana gwakwatenda kulola” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulongela genago, akaalobholelanga, “Aganja bhitu Alazalo agolwike, nambo nenga mbakujaula kwaajimua.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakaalobholela, “Mwe Hangwana, handa agolwike lugono, apakujimuka tu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ayesu atendita kulongela ngani ja kujomoka kwa Alazalo, nambo bhenaangota bhakaganikianga kubhee atendita kulongela ngani ja lugono. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga pangali kuhiya, “Alazalo ajomwike, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />nambo ndendakuhachukila ligongo linunji kubhee nangabhee konokwe tangu Alazalo abhi tangu kujomoka ili mwangota nhobhalelange. Henela nangocheni tujaulange kwachabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Atomasi jwaakemwa Mabhela akaalobholelanga bhabhachijigana akaajabhe, “Na twenga tujaulange tukajomoke pamo na Hangwana.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga uyoho na umomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ayesu pabhakaika konokwe akagukolela mmele gwa Alazalo gukibha guchikitwe mu likabhuli kwa machobha ncheche. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bahi chijiji cha Betania chikibha kubhandikila na Yelusalemu kutalika kwa kubhandikila maili hibhele kubhoka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bhayahudi bhajingi bhakibha bhatekuikanga kwa Amalata na Amalia kwalekelanga ntima kubhokana na malilo ga akaka bhabhenji.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Bahi, Amalata pabhakajoha Ayesu atendakuhika, akabhoka kujaula kwapokela, nambo Amalia akaigalila kaja. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Amalata akaalobholela Ayesu, “Mwe Hangwana, handa nkabhile pambani, akaka bhangu akajomwikehopo. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Nambo niimanyi kubhee hata nangocheni Annoongo apakumpekeha choachela chimpakwajopa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Ayesu akaakongolela, “Akaka jwinu apakuyoka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Amalata akaajangula, “Niimanyi kubhee apakuyoka mu kuyoka kwa bhabhawilinge lichobha lya kupela.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nenga nga uyoho na umomi. Mundu joajola jwanhobhalela nenga, hata handa apakujomoka apakubhee jwamomi, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />mundu joajola jwatama na kunhobhalela nenga, ngajomoka ng'o. Bholi ntendakulihobhalela hele?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Amalata akaajangula, “Helo mwe Hangwana! Nenga ndendakuhobhalela kubhee mwenga nga Akilisito jwaagulikwe na Annoogo, Mwana jwa Annoongo, jonijola jwahika pachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwagutila Alazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Amalata pabhakajomola kulongela genago, akajaula kwakema Amalia kwa kuchiiya, akaalobholela, “Bhabhajigana abhile pambani atendakunkema,” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Amalia pabhakajoha henela, akajinuka chindema kwaajendelela kubhakibha Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ayesu akibha tangu angajingila pa chijiji, ila akibha tangu maali penipala pabhakakongana na Amalata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Bhenibhala Bhayahudi bhabhakibhanga nkati bhabhikwalekelanga ntima Amalia, pabhakammona amalia chibhatekujimuka kwa chindema na kupita panja, bhakankagula. Bhakaganikianga kubhee ajaula kulikabuli kuguta.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Amalia pabhakaika penipala Ayesu pabhakibha, akatindibhala majugwa pamakongono gabhe na kulobhola, “Hangwana, handa nkabhile pambani akaka bhangu angajomwikehopo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ayesu pabhakaabhona Amalia abhikuguta na bhenibhala Bhayahudi bhabhakaikanga pamo na Amalia bhatendakugutanga, ikaabhina muntima gwabhe, akahechuka muno. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Munchikite koji?” Bhakaalobholela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">“Hangwana, nhiike mpalole.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Ayesu akaguta. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ngapena Bhayahudi bhakalobholanga, “Nnolange namuna chibhakampala Alazalo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Nambo bhandu bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Jonjoni jwatekwalamiha jonijola jwangalola, bholi, jwangakombola kwaalamiha Alazalo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwayoa Alazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Bahi, Ayesu abhi atekuhechuka kabhele muntima gwabhe, akahika palikabuli. Likabuli lyene likibha mbako, na likawekelwa kwa liganga. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Ayesu akalobhola, “Mmoange liganga hele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Amalata alombo jwa jonijola mundu jwajomwike akalobhola, “Hangwana, atendakununga, ligongo tangu achikwe leleni nga lichobha lya ncheche.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Ayesu akaalobholela Amalata, “Bholi, nangankongolela kubhee handa nkahobhalile mpakugubhona ng'anyimo gwa Annoongo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Henela bhakalibhoanga liganga lyenilyela. Ayesu akalola nnani kulihunde akaajopa kwa Annoongo, akalobhola, “Atati, ndendakunchukulu kwa kubhee ntendakunyoanikiha. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Niimanyi yakubhee mwenga ntendakunyoanikia machobha goha, nambo nongile gangani ligongo lya nkutuli hogo gugujemite pambani, ili bhahobhalele yakubhee mwenga nga jwandumite.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Pabhakajomola kulongela genago, Ayesu akakwea lilobhe lyabhe akakema, “Mwe Alazalo, nhike kongoni panja!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Jonijola jwakibha atekujomoka akapita panja, kongo mabhoko na makongo gabhe gabhigahigililwe chanda na kumiho kwabhe kubhikutabhitwe chitambaa. Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Munnyogolange, mwaaleke ajende.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhapalanga kwakoma Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Amatayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Amaluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Aluka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Henela Bhayahudi bhajingi bhabhakibha bhaikite na Amalia, pabhakabhonanga genigala gabhatendite Ayesu bhakanhobhalela. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Nambo bhangi bhakajaulanga kwa Mafalisayo na kwalobholelanga hikubho hibhatendite Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Henela Mafalisayo na akaakung'i akolongwa bhakamekanga balacha lya Bhayahudi, bhakakonyananga, “Tutenda bholi? Hojo mundu atenda hilolelo hijingi muno. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Handa twalekite apunde kutenda hilolelo yenjeni kila jumo apakunhobhalela, na akaakolo bha ku Loma na bhatabhala bha ku Loma bhapakuikanga na kugabhoanga mamulaka gitu nnani ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo na chilambo chitu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Penapo, jumo jwabhenji, jwakemitwa Akayafa, jwaakibha akung'i akolo chaaka chenecho akalobhola, “Mwangota ngachimanyanga chilebhe chohachela! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Bholi, ngamanyanga kubhee nga mbaya mundu jumo ajomoke ligongo lya bhandu, kupeta chilambo choa chialibiwe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Akayafa jwangalongela genago kwa kupala mwene, bali ligongo akibha akung'i akolongwa chaka chela, bhakalondola kubhee Ayesu bhakawile ligongo lya chilambo cha Bhayahudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />wala ngabha tu apakujomoka kwa bhabhabhilinge Bhayahudi jika, nambo hela hela abhakumbange bhana bha Annoongo bhabhapwilinganike bhabhangange pamo. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Henela kubhokela bhakajemekanga kuloleanga ndela ja kwaakoma Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ngapena Ayesu bhangajenda kabhele palugwinjili akibha na Bhayahudi, bali akatama nyenje akajaula palulemba kubhandikila pa chijiji chimo chikemitwa Aefulaimu. Akatama konokwe pamo na bhabhachijigana bhabhe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Bahi lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka lya Bhayahudi likabhandikila, bhandu bhajingi bhakabhoka kuhijiji bhakajendanga ku Yelusalemu kuchijelejeha ili bhakondekwe kwaachalila Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bhandu bhakibha bhantendakwalolea Ayesu, nabhena bhakajemanga pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhakakonyangana, “Bholi, hojo mundu ngahika ng'o palichobha likolongwa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Akaakung'i akolongwa na Mafalisayo bhakibha bhabhoite lilagilo kubhee mundu joajola jwapakuimanya maali pabhabhile Ayesu, abhalobholele na bhaakamule.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Amalia ampakaa mahuta gakunungila Ayesu konokwe ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Amatayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Amaluko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Machoha sita tangu ja lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka, Ayesu akajaula ku Betania konokwe kubhatamita Alazalo yakubhee Ayesu akaayoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Konokwe bhakahalakianga ndalilo, Amalata akibha atendita kwatumikilanga, Alazalo akibha jumo jwa bhenibhala jwatendita kutama na Ayesu kulyee. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Ngapena Amalia akatola chuupa cha mahuta gakungila maha ga bei ngolongwa akagakuchulila mmakongono ga Ayesu na kugauta kwa majungu gakwe. Nyuumba joa jikanungila maha. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ngapena Ayuda Isikalioti, jumo jwa bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe Ayesu yakubhee nga jwapakung'aluka Ayesu, akalobhola, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Kwa niki mauta gangani gangahuchwa kwa mbiya dinali mia tatu nga handa malepo ga miheyi jitatu na mbiya heyo twapekee akaahocho?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ayuda akalongela henela ngabha kwa kubhee akaakolee kiha muno akahocho, nambo ligongo akibha abhwihi, jonojwe nga jwaakibha jwakulolekea nhuko gwa mbiya na atendita kujibha chenichela chichibhekitwe monomwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nambo Ayesu akalobhola, “Munnekange. Akagaemela mahuta genago ili agabheke ligongo lya lichobha lyangu lya kuchikwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Akaahocho mmilingenabho machobha goa nambo ngabhee na nenga machobha goa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhayahudi bhapalanga kwakoma Alazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Nkutuli nkolongwa gwa Bhayahudi pabhajoanga kubhee Ayesu akibha konokwe ku Betania, bhakajaulanga konokwe ngabha kwalola Ayesu jikajabhe, nambo hela hela bhapalitanga kwalola Alazalo, mundu jonijola yakubhee Ayesu akaayoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Akaakung'i akolongwa bhakaloleanga kabhele ndela ja kwakoma Alazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ligongo lya kuyoka Alazalo Bhayahudi bhajingi bhatendita kwalekanga akachilongola bhabhenji, bhakaajendelela Ayesu na kunhobhalela.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakujingila ku Yelusalemu kwa kuhangalala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Amatayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Amaluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Aluka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Malabhi jakwe, nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu bhabhakahikanga mu lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka bhakajoanga kubhee Ayesu akibha nndela kuhika ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Bahi, bhakaheketanga nyaambi ya mikongo ja mitende, bhakabhokanga kujaula kwapokela, kongo bhabhikweanga lilobhe bhabhikulobholanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Alumbalilwe Hangwana! Atendilwe gammbone jonojwe jwahika kwa lina lya Hangwana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Atendilwe gammbone Amwenye bha Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Ayesu bhakankolela mwana liponda jumo, akatama nnani jakwe handa chiijandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />Mwe mwa bhandu bha ku Yelusalemu, “Nkotokujogopa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Nnole, Amwenye jwinu atendakuika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">akwelite mwana liponda!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Bhabhachijigana bhabhe Ayesu kandahi bhangaelewa hikubho heye, nambo Annoongo pabhakalangia kubhee Ayesu chibhabhile akolo, penapo nga pabhakakombokaelanga kubhee hikubho heye hikajandikwa ligongo lyabhe, na kubhee bhandu bhakaatendela henela.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Nkutuli gwa bhandu bhenibhala bhabhakibhanga pamo na Ayesu pakaakema Alazalo kubhoka kulikabuli na kwayoa, bhatendita kujeneanga hikubho yela hiikabhokela. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Nga kwa ligongo bhandu bhajingi bhakajaula kwapokela, ligongo bhakajoanga chilolelo hecho chibhakatenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Henela Mafalisayo pabhakagabhona genago bhakakonyananga, “Bholi, tendakubhonanga? Ngakombolanga kutenda choachela! Nnolange, bhandu bhoa bha pachilambo bhatendakunkagula jonojwe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu alondola ngani ja kujomoka na kuyoka kwabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Pakati ja bhandu bhabhakajaulanga ku Yelusalemu mu lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka pakati jabhenji bhakibhanga Bhagiliki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Bhandu abho bhakajaulanga kwa Afilipo, mundu jwa kubhoka ku Betisaida mu chilambo cha Galilaya, bhakajopanga bhabhikulobholanga, “Mwakolo, twenga tupala kwabhona Ayesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Afilipo akajaula, akaakongolela Aandulea, na penapo bhoha bhabhele bhakajaulanga kwalobhobholela Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Muda gwa Mwana jwa Mundu kulangikwa guhikite. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kweli ndendakunnobholela, mbeju ja mpoonga handa ngagwee na kumela, jipakuhigalila mbeju jojojo. Nambo handa jiwile jipakuhogola mbeju hijingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Bhandu bhala bhabhapalanga umomi gwabhenji bhapakuguhobhea, na bhabhapakuguchimwa umomi gwabhenji mu chilambo heche bhapagutendanga umomi gwabhenji gubhee gwa machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Joajola jwandumikila hipaalikwa kungagula, na penipala pambakubhee nenga nga ntumichi jwangu pabhapakubhee. Atati bhangu apakwatopea mundu joajola jwandumikila nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwajopa Annoongo ligongo lya malilo gabhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Nangocheni ntima gwangu gutendakulaga muno, na nobhole chiniki? Bholi, nobhole, ‘Atati, nhokoe kubhoka mu ibhini heye?’ Ngabha, nga ligongo nakahika nyomoke ligongo lya bhangi. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Atati, litopelwa lina linu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ngapena lilobhe likajoanika kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo, “Ndekulitopea na nenga mbakulitopea kabhele.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu gugukajema penapo bhakajoanga lilobhe lyenelyo, na bhandu bhangi pakati jabhenji bhakalobholanga, njai jitendakulindimila, bhangi bhakalobhola, “Antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo alongile nabho!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Lilobhe hele lijohanike ligono linunji, ngabha ligongo lyangu nenga. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Nangocheni nga muda gwa bhandu bha chilambo heche kuhukumulwa, ngocheni akolo bha chilambo heche apakupokonyolwa ukolo gwabhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nambo nenga, pambakubhambwa panchalaba, mbakwahutanga bhandu bhoa bhaikange kwachangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ayesu akalogela gangani abhikulangia malilo gabhapakujomoka.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu gukapota nyenye gubhikulobhola, “Malagilo gitu gatulobholela kubhee, Akilisito jwaagulikwe na Annoongo apakubhee machobha goa. Kwa niki mwenga nnobhola Mwana jwa Mundu apalikwa kubhambwa panchalaba? Bholi, hojo Mwana jwa Mundu nga ganiki?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nhana tangu gubhile pamo na mwangota kwa muda nnyipinyipi. Nnyendange mmi tangu na nhana, ili lubhendu lukotokunkolelanga, ligongo jwajenda mulubhendu ngamanya kwajaula. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Bahi, nhobhalelange nhana gonogwe ili nkombolange kubhee bhana bha gonogwe nhana.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Bhayahudi bhakananga kwahobhalela Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Pabhakajomola kulongela genago, Ayesu akabhoka na akachiiya bhakotombolanga kummona.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hata handa Ayesu akatenda hilolelo hijingi nnoongi jabhenji, nambo bhenaangota bhangahobhalelanga. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Henela malobhe gabhalongile alondohi bha Annoongo Aisaya gakakwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mwe Hangwana, ganiki jwahobhalile ngani jangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Bholi, ukolo gwa kuhokoa gwa Annoongo gutekuhunukulikwa kwa aganiki?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Chenecho nga chibhakaatendanga bhakotokwahobhalela Ayesu, ligongo hele hela Aisaya akalongela kabhele,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Annoongo akaatujulanga miho gabhenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">akaatenda mitima kubhee jakulimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">bhakotokulola kwa miho gabhenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">bhakotokuelewanga kwa mitima jabhenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wala bhakotokundendebhukila nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na nenga na ngalaamie.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Aisaya akalobhola malobhe gangani ligongo akagubhona ng'anyimo gwa Ayesu, na akalongela ngani jabhe Ayesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Henela bhajingi pakati ja akanachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakanhobhalela Ayesu. Nambo ligongo lya Mafalisayo bhangalongelanga palundwanje kwa kujogopa kubhee bhapakubhekwanga nnyenje mu nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Bhakapalanga kulumbalilwa na bhandu kupunda kulumbalilwa na Annoongo.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atekuhika pachilambo kwahokoanga bhandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ayesu akapalia lilobhe akalobhola, “Mundu joajola jwanhobhalela nenga, ngahobhalela nenga jika jangu, ila hela hela atendakunhobhalela na jonijola jwandumite. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Joajola jwamona nenga, hela hela amweni jonijola jwandumitwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nenga ndekuhika pachilambo ili bhandu bhagumanyange nhana gwa kweli ya Annoongo ili kila bhabhahobhalela nenga bhakotokutamanga mulubhendu pangali kugumanya ukweli gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mundu joajola handa agajoine malobhe gangu na kugakonda nenga nganhukumula, nambo nangahika kwahukumula bhandu bha pachilambo nambo ndekuhika kwahokoanga. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Mundu joajola jwaangana nenga na jwangapokela malobhe gangu akweti gwa kuhukumula. Malobhe gangu gandendakulongela nga gagapakunhumula mu lichobha lya kupela. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ligongo ngalongela kwa ukolo gwangu mwene, ila Atati jwandumite nga jwatekunagia nongela chiniki na nongebholi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na nenga niimanyi kubhee amuli nga umomi gwa machobha goa. Bahi, nenga nongela tu genigala Atati jwanobholile nigalongele.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwajelejea makongono bhabhachijigana bhabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Pajikibha jibhandikile lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka pagukahika. Ayesu akaimanya muda gwa kubhoka mu chilambo heche na kujaula kwa Atati gutekuika. Akibha atenditakwapala bhandu bhabhe bhabhabhilinge pachilambo, kweli, akaapalanga mpaka kupela kwa umomi gwabhe.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Bahi, Ayesu na bhabhachijigana bhabhe, bhakatamanga kulyee ndalilo. Abohu akaajambua Ayuda Isikalioti, mwana jwa Asimoni, jwakaagaluka Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Ayesu kongo abhi kuimanya kubhee Atati abhekite hilebhe yoha pahi ja ukolo gwabhe. Na akahimanya kubhee abhoka kwa Annoongo na atenditakubhuja kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Bahi, akaleka kulyee, akahula chiwalo chebhe cha panja, akatola chitambaa cha kujomea machi na akachibha ngobho ja kuchihungutila machi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ngapena akalekela machi mubakuli kolongwa na akajemeka kwajelejea bhabhachijigana bhabhe makongono na kwaahuta kwa chitambaa chenichela chibhakachitabha muchibhuno. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Bahi, pabhakanhikila Asimoni Petulo, Apetulo akaakonya, “Hangwana, upakunyelejea na nenga makongono?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Chindenda nangocheni mwenga ngachimanya, nambo mpakuimanya muuda guguhika.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Apetulo akalobholela, “Ng'o mwenga nganyelejea makongono gangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Ayesu akaajangula, “Handa nganyelejea makongono ginu ngakwelekana na nenga kabhele.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Ngapena Asimoni Petulo akaajangula, “Hangwana, nkotokunyelejea makongono gangu jika, nambo hela hela mutwe gwangu pamo na mmele goha!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Mundu jwajogite ngapaalikwa kujoga kabhele apalikwa kua makongono, kwa kubhee mmele gwake gwoha nga gutekuhalala. Mwangota ntekuhalalanga, nambo ngabha bhoa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ayesu akibha atendakummanya jonijola jwapakung'aluka, nga kwa kubhee akalobhola henela, “Mwangota ntekuhalalanga, nambo ngabha bhoa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kwajelejeanga mkongono gabhenji, akawala ngobho jabhe kabhele, akabhuja pachakulya pabhakibha. Akaakonyanga, “Bholi, mmanyanga genago ganakantendelanga?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mwangota nngemanga nenga, “Bhannyigana na Hangwana, mwangota nnongelanga maha, ligongo nenga nga jonojwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Bahi, handa chindekubhee Hangwana na Bhannyigana bhinunji ndekunyelejeanga mwangota makongono, na mwangota hela hela mpalikwanga kujelejeananga makongono ginunji. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ndekunnangianga yakubhehe, na mwangota ntendage henela handa chindekuntendelanga mwangota. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, abhanda nga nkolongwa kupunda mwe akolo bhabhe, na antumichi nga nkolongwa handa jonijola jwantumite. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Nangocheni kwa kubhee mmanyitinge hikubho yakutenda, Annoongo apakuntendelanga gammbone handa mpakugatendanga.”<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Ngannongelanga henela kwa mwangota bhoha, ndenda kwaamanyanga bhenibhala bhanahagwile. Nambo ipalikwa Majaandiko gapate kukwela, ‘Jwalile chakulya changu atekung'aluka.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ndenga ndekunnobholela hikubho heye nangocheni tangu gangapitila, ili chigapakupitila nkombolange kuhobhalela yakubhe, ‘Nenga nga jonojwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kweli ndendakunnobholela, joajola jwampokela jonijola jwandumite, ambokile nenga, na jonojwe jwambokela nenga ampokela na jonijola jwandumite.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu alongela namuna chibhapakugalukwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Amatayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Amaluko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Aluka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulongela genago, akapata hibhini muno muntima gwabhe, akalobhola, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, jumo pakati jinunji apakung'aluka.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakalolananga, nambo bhangahimanya atendita kwalongela ganiki. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Jumo jwa bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe, yakubhehe Ayesu atendita kumpala muno, akibha atamite kubhandikila na Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Bahi, Asimoni Petulo akankinyila jonijola jwachijigana akaalobholela, “Mwakonye atendakwalobhola aganiki.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Jwachijigana jonojwe akibha atekwajegamila Ayesu pantima, akaakonya, “Hangwana aganiki jwapakung'aluka?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Mundu jonijola jumbakumpekea chipande cha nkate chimbakutobhela mu nchuchi nga jonojwe.” Bahi, pabhakatobhela chipande chenecho cha nkate mu nchuchi, akampekea Ayuda, mwana jwa Asimoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Palapala Ayuda pabhakapokela chenecho chipande cha nkate, Lichetani likaajingila. Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholela Ayuda, “Chenecho chimpala kutenda, ntende chindema.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nambo pakati ja bhenibhala bhabhakibha bhatenda kulyee nabho chakulya jwakwa hata jumo jwakahimanya kwa niki Ayesu atekwalobholela henela Ayuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwa kubhee Ayuda akibha jwagukamula nhuko gwa mbiya, bhangi bhakaganikianga Ayesu akaalobholela Ayuda akaemele hilebhe hiipalikwa ligongo lya lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka, au kwaapekeanga hilebhe akaahocho choachela.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Bahi, Ayuda pabhakalyee chipande chenichela cha nkate, akapita panja chindema. Na ikibha kilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli jiyono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ayuda pabhakabhoka panja, Ayesu akalobhola, “Nangocheni Mwana jwa Mundu atopelwe, na nkati jabhe hela hela Annoongo atekutopelwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Handa Annoongo ung'anyimo gwa Annoongo gutekuhunulikwa nkati ja Mwana, Annoongo apakuguhunukula ung'anyimo nkati ja Mwana na apakwatopea chindema.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Bhana bhangu, bhanampalanga tangu mile pamo na mwangota kwa muda nchokoko. Mpakunoleanga, nambo chinakankongolelanga Bhayahudi na mwangota ndendakunnobholelanga hela hela, ‘Kunyaula nenga, mwangota ngakombola kuikanga.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ndendakumpekeanga Amuli jiyono, mpalanange mwangota kwa mwangota, handa heela chinakampalanga mwangota, na mwangota ntendange. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Handa mpalaninge, bhandu bhoa bhapakuimanya kubhee mwangota nga bhabhachigana bhangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakulondola kubhee Apetulo apakunkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Amatayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Amaluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Aluka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Asimoni Petulo akaakonya, “Bholi, Hangwana, nnyaula koji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Kunyaula nangocheni mwenga ngakombola kungagula, nambo mpakungagula muuda guguhika.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Apetulo akaakonya kabhele, “Hangwana, kwa niki ngakombola kunkagula nangocheni? Nenga ngombola kujomoka ligongo linu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Bholi, nga kweli mwenga nkombola kujomoka ligongo lyangu ligongo lyangu? Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, tangu likambaliko kujemba mpakungana patatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga ndela ja kujaula kwa Atati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nkotokuhechuka mumitima jinunji, mwahobhalele Annoongo, hela hela nhobhalelange na nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Nyuumba ja Atati bhangu mubhile mwa kutama mujingi. Handa nga henela, ngannobholilinge. Ndendakujaula kumpanganikianga pakutama. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Nanenga ananyawile na kunhalakianga pakutama, mbakubhuja kabhele kuntolanga ntamange pamo nanenga, ili mwangota mmangange penipala pamile nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na konikola kunyaula mwangota mujimanyi jene ndela.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Atomasi akaakonya, “Hangwana, twenga ngakumanya kunyaula, bholi tupakujimanyabholi jene ndela.”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Nenga namwene nga ndela, ndendakwalobholelanga bhandu ukweli gwa Annoongo na ndendakwapekea umomi gwa machobha goha. Jwakwa mundu jwahika kwa Atati pangali kupetela kwaachangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Handa ntendakumanya nenga, mpakummanya na Atati bhangu. Kubhokela nangocheni, ntendakummanya Atati bhangu, kabhele ntekwabhona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Afilipo akaalobholela, “Hangwana, nangocheni ntulangie jono Atati, jono nga jutumpala.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Afilipo, ndekutama na mwenga machobha gajingi, bholi, nganimanya? Mundu joajola jwamonite nenga, abhonite Atati. Nangocheni nkombolabholi kulongela, ‘Ntulangie Atati?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Bholi, Afilipo ngahobhalela kubhee nenga mile nkati ja Atati, na jono Atati abhile nkati jangu? Ngannobholelanga gagabhile gangu nambo Atati jwabhile nkati jangu atenda mahengo gabhe.” <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nhobhalelange panannobholelanga kubhee mile nkati ja Atati na Atati abhi nkati jangu nenga. Handa nganhobhalelanga nhobhalelange ligongo lya mahengo gambangana. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, mundu joajola jwanhobhalela nenga, apakupangana mahengo genigala gambagana, apakutenda mahengo makolongwa kupunda nenga kwa kubhee nyaula kwa Atati bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Hana nnyopitinge chilebhe handa chimbala nenga mbakuchitenda, ili Atati atopelwe nkati ja Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Hana nnyopitinge chilebhe handa chimbala nenga mbakuchitenda.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu alongela apakwaleta Mboomo ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Handa ntendakupamba, mpakutendanga amuli yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Mbakwajoopa Atati, na jonojwe apakumpekeanga Ajangatii jongi apakutama na mwangota machobha goa. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Jonojwe nga Mboomo ja Annoongo jwaalangia ukweli gwa Annoongo. Bhandu bha pachilambo ngakombola kwaapokela ligongo ngakombola kwalola wala kwaamanya. Nambo mwangota ntendakwamanya ligongo abhi pamo na mwangota na atama nkati jinunji.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Pambakubhoka ngannekanga handa akaakebha, mbakubhuja kabhele kutama na mwangota. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Tangu kachoko bhandu bha pachilambo ngamonanga kabhele, nambo mwangota mpakumonanga, ligongo mbakubhee naamomi kabhele, na mwangota mpakubhee na umomi gwa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Lichobha lyalela palipakuhika mpakumanya nenga kubhee mile nkati ja Atati, na mwangota mmilinge nkati jangu, na nenga mile nkati jinunji.”<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Mundu joajola jwapokela malagilo gangu na kugakamula, mundu jonojwe jwambala nenga. Na Atati atenda kumpala jonijola jwambala nenga, na nenga mbakumpala na kuchilangia kwaachabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ngapena Ayuda, ngabha jonijola Isikalioti, akaalobholela, “Hangwana, ipakubheebholi mwenga kuchilangia kwachitu jika na ngabha kwa bhandu bha pachilambo?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Bhandu bhala bhabhambala nenga bhapakutendanga chinaalobholelanga na Atati bhangu apakwaapalanga bhena bhandu, nenga na Atati bhangu tupakuhikanga kwaachinu kutama nabho. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mundu joajola jwangambala nenga ngatenda chinaalobholela. Na ngani jimujijoha ngabha jangu, bali jibhoka kwa Annoongo jwandumite.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Ndekunnyigananga hikubho yenjeni mi pamo na mwangota. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Atati bhangu apakuntumilanga Ajangatii, jonojwe nga Mboomo ja Annoongo kwa lina lyangu, apakunnyigangakila hikubho yoa na kunkomboanga kila chilebhe chingakannobholelanga.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Kuhengwa ndendakunnekelanga, ndendakumpekeanga kuhengwa kwangu, ngampekeanga mwangota handa henela bhandu bha pachilambo chibhatendakumpekeanga. Nkotokubhee na lipamba mu mitima jinunji na nkotokujogopanga. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Nkanyoanga panakannobholelanga, ‘Ndendakujaula, na mbakubhuja kabhele.’ Handa nkambalanga, nkahachukilinge kujoa ndendakujaula kwa Atati, ligongo Atati nga akolo kupunda nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ndekunnobholelanga hikubho heye tangu gangapitila, ili pagapakupitila nhobhalelange. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Ngalongela muno na mwangota, ligongo jonijola nkolongwa jwa chilambo heche atendakuika, ligongo kwaachangu nenga ngakombola chilebhe. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />nambo bhandu bha pachilambo bhapalikwa bhaimanyange kubhee ndendakwapala Atati, nga kwa maana ndenda kila chilebhe Atati chibhangulumikie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Nangocheni nnyimukange, tubhokange pambani.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga mzabibu gwa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Ngapena Ayesu akalobhola, “Nenga na mzabibu gwa kweli, na Atati bhangu nga alemi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kila nyaambi nkati jangu lyangaogola matunda, Atati bhangu atenda kuliheketa, na kila nyaambi liliogola kuliheketela ili liogole muno. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mwangota ntekubhee chwapi mumitima ligongo ntekujelejekwa kwa ngani jenijela jinakannobholelanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ntamange nkati jangu, handa nenga chindama nkati jinu. Nyaambi ja mzabibu handa ngakamula na litepo ngakombola kuhogola matunda. Henela mwangota ngakombola kutenda chenichela chibhachipala Annoongo handa ngatama nkati jangu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nenga nga mzabibu, na mwangota nga nyaambi. Bhenibhala bhabhatamanga nkati jangu, na nenga handa mile nkati jabhenji, bhenaangota bhapakutendanga hikubho hijingi muno hiyabhajila Annoongo, ligongo pangali nenga ngakombolanga kupangana choachela. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mundu joajola handa ngatama nkati jangu alandana na nyaambi lilitekujoma na kunyilila. Nyaambi handa lyeneyo hilondanikwa na kulekelwa pamooto na kutinika. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mwangota handa ntamanga nkati jangu na malobhe gangu gakatama nkati jinunji, bahi nnyopange choachela chimpalanga na mwangota mpakupatanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Atati bhangu kutukuchwa handa mpakutendanga gajingi genigala gagammajila Annoongo na mwangota mpakubhee bhabhachijigana bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ndekumpalanga mwangota handa henela Atati chibhambalite nenga. Ntamange kongo mmikumanyanga ndendakumpalanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Handa mpakondanga Malagilo gangu, mpakutamanga mu upaliho gwangu handa henela na nenga chindendakonda Malagilo ga Atati bhangu na kutama mu upaliho gwabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Ndekunnobholelanga hikubho heye yoha ili kuhangalala kwangu kutame nkati jinu, na kuhangalala kwinunji kukweele. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Lyene nga lilagilo lyangu kwaachinu, kubhee mpalanange handa nenga chinakampalanga mwangota. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Jwakwa mundu jwaabhile na upaliho nkolongwa kupeta upaliho gwa mundu jwaagubhoa umomi gwabhe ligongo lya akaaganja bhabhe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mwangota nga akaaganja bhangu handa ntenditinge genigala gandekunnagianga. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ngamkemanga kabhele mwangota akaatumichi, kwa kubhee antumichi ngamanya chibhatenda akolo bhabhe. Nambo ndenkunkemanga mwangota akaaganja, ligongo ndekunhunukulilanga kila chilebhe chinichijoine kwa Atati bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mwangota mwangahagula nenga, ila nenga nga ndekunhagulanga mwangota na kunnagianga nkatendange genigala gabhagapala Annoongo, yakubhee gapakutama machobha goa. Na Atati apakunpekeanga choachela chimpakujopanga kwa lina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ndendakumpeanga Lilagilo lyangu, mpalanange mwangota kwa mwangota.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha pachilambo bhapakunchimwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Bhandu pachilambo handa bhanchimwitinge, mmanyange kubhee bhakajemekanga kunjimwa nenga tangu jinunji mwangota. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Handa nkabhilinge bhandu bha pachilambo chenjeni, bhandu bha chilambo bhakampalitinge handa bhandu bhabhe. Nambo kwa kubhee mwangota ngabha bhandu bha chilambo heche, ila nenga ndekunhagulanga kubhoka chilambo chenjeni, nga ligongo bhandu bha pachilambo bhatendakunchimwanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Nkombokelange malobhe ganannobholilinge, ‘Antumichi nga akolo kupunda hangwana bhabhe.’ Handa bhandu bhakanagia nenga, na mwangota hela hela bhapakunnagianga, handa bhakakondanga malobhe gangu, hela hela bhapakugakonda na malobhe ginunji. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Bhapakuntendelanga hikubho heyo ligongo mwangota ntendakungagula nenga, kwa kubhee bhangammanya jonojwe jwaandumite. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Handa ngehikitehopo na kwalobholelanga malobhe ga Annoongo, bhakebheehopo na mabohu, nambo nangocheni ngakombolanga kuchitetela kubhee bhanga mabohu. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Mundu joajola jwaanjimwa nenga, hela hela atendakwaachimwa na Atati bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Handa nangatenda hikubho pakati jabhenji yakubhee jwakwa mundu jwatendite, nangocheni bhakalemwitingehopo. Nambo nenga nibhikutenda hikubho heyo, na bhenaangota bhatekunjimwa nenga na Atati bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Nambo aga gatendikwe ili genigala gagajandikwe mu Majandiko ga Annoongo gakwele, ‘Bhatekunjimwa pangali kulemwa.’”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Nambo chibhapakuhika jonojwe jwa pahi jangu, nga chimbakwaatuma Ajangatii kubhoka kwa Atati bhangu, jonojwe Mboomo jwa Annoongo. Jonojwe apakunnobholelanga ngani yangu yoa. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Na mwangota mpakwalobholelanga bhandu ngani yangu, kwa kubhee mwakibha na nenga mwangota kubhokela kandahi.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Ayesu akapunda kwaalobholelanga, “Ndekunnobholelanga malobhe genago nchitimalikange ili nkoto kwakana Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bhandu bhapakummenganga mwangota mu Nyuumba ya kuchalila Bhayahudi, muda gutenda kuhika yakubhee kila mundu jwapakunkoma mwangota apakuganikia atendakunchalila Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bhandu bhapakwatendelanga hikubho yenjeni yoha ligongo ngaamanya Atati wala nenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ndekunnobholelanga mwangota hikubho heye, ili muda chigupakuhika nkombokelange yakubhee nakannobholelanga.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Lihengo lya Mboomo jwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Nangannobholelanga gangani tangu kandahi kwa kubhee nakibha pamo na mwangota. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nambo nangocheni ndendakujaula kwa jonijola jwandumite, jwakwa mundu jwaangonya, ‘Nnyaula koji?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwa kubhee ligongo ndekunnobholelanga genago goha mitima jinunji jitekuumalika. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Nambo nannobholelnga kweli, mbaya kwaachinu nenga nyaule, handa ngajaula Ajangatii ngahika kwaachinunji. Nambo handa nyawile mbaakuntuma kwaachinunji. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Na bhenabho chibhapakuhika, apakwaalangia bhandu bha pachilambo kubhee bhatekulemwa nnani ja mabhou, hikubho hiikondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo na hukumulo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Bhatekutendanga mabohu ligongo nganhobhalelanga nenga, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Mboomo ja Annoongo apakunnangia nnani ja kondekwa kwangu nnongi ja Annoongo, ligongo nenga ndendakujaula kwa Atati na mwangota ngammona nenga kabhele. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Nnani ja hukumulo, ligongo Lichetani akolo bha chenjeni chilambo atekuhukumulwa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Tangu ngweti gajingi gakunnobholelanga, nambo kwa nangocheni ngakombolanga kugakamulanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Chibhapakuhika jonojwe Mboomo jwa kweli apakunnangianga mu ukweli goha. Kwa kubhee ngalongela kwa ukolo gwabhe ila apakulongela genigala chibhatekugajoa na apakwaalobholela genigala gabhagajoa kubhoka kwaachangu na kwaalobholelanga genigala gagakupitila nnongi. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Jonojwe apakundopea nenga, kwa maana apakunyigananga genigala gabhapakugapata kubhoka kwaachangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Yoha hibabhinayo Atati nga yangu nenga, nga maana ndekunnobholelanga Mboomo jwa Annoongo apakunnyigananga kongolelanga genigala bhabhagapatite kubhoka kwaachangu.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhechuka na kuhangalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Tangu muda nchoko na mwangota ngamonanga kabhele nambo muda nchoko guguhika mwangota mpakumonanga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Penapo bhabhachijigana bhangi bhakakonyangana, “Abhi na maana niki pabhalobhola, ‘Tangu muda nchoko na mwangota ngamonanga kabhele nambo muda nchoko guguhika mwangota mpakumonanga.’ Kabhele alobhola, ‘Ligongo ndendakujaula kwa Atati?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Bhakapundanga konyananga, abhi na maana niki pabhalobhola, ‘Tangu muda nchoko?’ Twangahimanya lyenelyo libhalongela!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Ayesu akahimanya kubhee pabhapalanga kwaakonya, henela akaalobholelanga, bholi ntendakonyanga ligongo “Ndekulobhola, ‘Tangu muda nchoko na mwangota ngamonanga kabhele nambo muda nchoko guguhika mwangota mpakumonang.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, mwangota mpakugutanga na kuumalika, nambo bhandu bha pachilambo bhapakuhangalala, mwangota mpakuhechukanga nambo kuhechuka kwinunji kupakutendebhuka na kubhee kuhangalala. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Haikege pabhachijogola mwana, atendakuhechuka ligongo muda kwa hibhini guhikite, nambo pabhachijogola mwana, jonijola mwikege atenda kulibhalila hibhini yabhe ila atenda kuhangalala ligongo mwana atekubhelekwa pachilambo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Bahi, mwangota hela hela nangocheni ntekuhechukanga, nambo mbakwalola kabhele, na mwangota mpakuhachukilanga mu mitima jinunji na jwakwa mundu jwapakunpokanga kuhachuka kwinunji.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Lichobha helyo palipakuhika, nganyopanga nenga chilebhe choachela. Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, anamunyopite chilebhe choachela Atati handa chiitendakummajila nenga apakumpekeanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mpaka nangocheni mwanganyopanga chilebhe choachela kwa ukolo gwangu. Nnyopange na mwangota mpakupekewanga, ili kuhachukanga kwinunji kukweele.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atekupeta machili gabohu ga chilambo heche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Ndekulobhola na mwangota hikubho heye kwa kulenganikia. Nambo muda gupakuhika yakubhee ngalongela na mwangota kwa kulengania, ila mbakulongela na mwangota ndaa ngani ja Atati bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Lichobha palipakuhika, mpakujopanga kwa namuna chintendakunhobhalela nenga. Ngannobholelanga kubhee nenga mbakunyopelanga kwa Atati ligongo linunji, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwa kubhee Atati mweene atendakumpalanga mwangota. Ligongo mwangota nkambalanga nenga na ntekuhobhalela kubhee ndekubhoka kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nenga ndekubhoka kwa Atati, na ndekuhika pambani pachilambo, nangocheni ndenda kuchileka chilambo na kubhuja kwa Atati.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Penapo bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakaalobholela, “Nangocheni nnongela ndaa, pangali kulengania. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nangocheni tuhimanyite kubhee mwenga ntendakuganyama goha, henela twangapala kunkonya chilebhe choachela. Henela tutendakuhobhalela kubhee mmokite kwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Bholi, nangocheni ntendakuhobhalelanga? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Muda gutenda kuhika, na gutekuhika, yakubhee mwangota mwabhoa mpakupwilinganika kila jumo apakujaula kwaachakwe na kunneka jikajangu. Nambo nenga ngabha jika jangu ligongo mi pamo na Atati. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ndekunnobholelanga hikubho heyo yoha ili ntamange kwa kuhengwa kwa kulondanikanga na nenga. Mu chilambo heche mpakulaganga. Nambo nchipekeange ntima! Kwa kubhee nenga ndekupeta machili gabohu ga chilambo heche!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwajopela bhabhachijigana bhabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, akalola kunani kwa Annoongo na kulobhola, “Atati, saa jitekuhika, mwatende habha bhandu bhantopee Mwana jwinu, ili Mwana jwinu bhantopee mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwa kubhee ntekumpekea Mwana jwinu ukolo kwa bhandu bhoa bhenibhala ili bhaapekeange umomi gwa machobha goha gummbekie. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na gono umomi gwa machobha goha nga gongoni, bhammanyange mwenga, Annoongo jika bha kweli, na bhammanye Ayesu Kilisito jumutumite. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nenga ndekuntopea mwenga pachilambo, kwa kupangana lihengo lintekumbekea kulipangana. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nangocheni, ndopee nnongi jinu kwa gonigola ng'anyimo guminago pamo na mwenga tangu ja kuhalakikwa kwa chilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Ndekuntenda mmanyike kwa bhandu bhenibhala bhambekie pachilambo. Bhakibhanga bhandu bhinu, na mwenga nkambekea nenga, na bhenaangota bhatekujeketelanga malobhe ginu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Nangocheni bhatendakuhimanyanga kila chilebhe chiummbekie nenga hibhokite kwaachinu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kwa kubhee malobhe gaummbekie nenga na nenga ndekwaapekeanga bhenaangota, na bhenaangota bhatekugapokelanga na kuhimanya kubhee kweli ndekubhoka kwaachinu, na bhatendakuhobhalela kubhee kweli mwenga nga jundumite nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Ndendakwajopelanga bhenaangota. Nenga ngaajopelanga bhandu bha pachilambo, ila ndendakwaajopelanga bhenibhala bhandu bhantekumbekea ligongo habha nga bhinu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Bhandu bhoa bhaminabho nga bhinu, na bhandu bhinu bhoa nga bhangu, na ukolo gwangu gutekuhunukulikwa nkati jabhenji bhenaangota bhantekumbekea. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Nangocheni ndendabhoka mu chilambo heche kuhika kwaachinu, nambo bhenaangota tangu bhabhilinge pachilambo. Atati bha jika! Choonde mwalolekee bhabhangagula nenga na mwabheke handa chimmile mwenga, ili bhabhee chilebhe chimo handa nenga na mwenga chitubhile pamo. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Panakibha pamo na bhenaangota, nakaalolekenga handa chinkapala mwenga. Jwakwa hata jumo jwaaobhite, ila jonijola jwaakapalikwa kuhobha, ili Majandiko gakweele. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Bahi, nangocheni ndendakuhika kwaachinu, ngalongela haga goa panakibha tangu pachilambo, ili bhabhee na kuhachukanga mu mitima jabhenji. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nenga ndekwaapekeanga lilobhe linu, na bhandu bha pachilambo bhatekwachimwa, ligongo bhenaangota ngabha bha chilambo, na nenga ngabha bha chilambo heche. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nenga ngajopa mwabhoange mu chilambo, nambo ndendakujopa mwalolekee kubhoka kwa jonijola Abohu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Nenga ngabha bha chilambo heche, handa henela bhenaangota ngabha bha chilambo heche. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Mwatende habha bhandu bhaimanye jenijela kweli, lilobhe linu nga lya kweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ntekunduma pachilambo, na nenga ndekwaatumanga pachilambo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ndendakuchibheka mwene kwaachinu ili bhenaangota bhachikonjange, na bhenaangota bhatendekwe bhebhee bhinu kwa kupetela ukweli.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ngaajopelanga bhenaangota jikajabhenji, nambo ndenda kwaajopelanga na bhenibhala bhoa bhabhapakungonda nenga kwa majigano gabhenji. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ndendakwaajopela bhoa bhabhee chilebhe chimo. Atati! Ndendakujopa bhatamange nkati jitu handa henela mwenga chintendakutama nkati jangu na nenga ndame nkati jinu. Ndendakujopa bhabhee chilebhe chimo ili bhandu bha pachilambo bhahobhalelange kubhee mwenga utekunduma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Kundopea kuntekumbekea na nenga ndekwapekeanga bhenaangota, ili bhabhee chilebhe chimo handa na tweenga chitubhile chilebhe chimo. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nenga mbakutama nkati jabenji, na mwenga mpakutama nkati jangu. Ili bhenaangota bhachitimalikange bhabhee chilebhe chimo, ili bhandu bha pachilambo bhaimanyange kubhee mwenga nga jundumite nenga, na ntendakwapalanga bhenaangota handa chintendakumbala nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Atati! Mbala bhenaangota bhantekumbekea bhabhee pamo na nenga mahali panipakubhee, ili bhagubhone ukolo gwangu guntekumbekea. Kwa kubhee nkambala tangu chilambo changahalakilwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Atati juntenda chikubho chammbone kila muda! Bhandu bha pachilambo ngammanya mwenga, nambo nenga ndendakummanya. Na habha bhatendakuhimanya kubhee mwenga nga nndumite. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nenga nanaatenda bhakumanye mwenga na mbakupunda kutenda henela, ili upaliyo gumminago kwaachangu gubhee nkati jabhenji, na nenga ndame nkati jabhenji.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakamulikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Amatayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Amaluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Aluka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulongela, akabhoka pamo na bhabhachijigana bhabhe kujaula kuntundu ja likote lya ku Kediloni, akajaula mahali papakapandwa mikongo ja mizeituni, akajingila monomwe pamo na bhabhachijigana bhabhe. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Bahi, Ayuda jonijola jwaagaluka Ayesu akapamanya penapo kwa kubhee mala hijingi Ayesu akibha atenda kongana na bhabhachijigana bhabhe penapo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Henela Ayuda akajaula mahali penapo, abhikutandaa lilubhalo lya manyemba bha ku Loma na akaalendei bhangi bhabhakatumwanga na akaakung'i akolongwa na Mafalisayo. Bhakahikanga bhakibhanga kandili, lumuli na hilaa. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Bahi, Ayesu abhi kuhimanya gagapala kwaakolela, akachipia nnongi jabhenji akaakonyanga, “Ntendanga kwalolea ganiki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bhenaangota bhakaajangula, “Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nenga nga jonojwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Ayuda jwakagaluka Ayesu akibha ajemite penapo pamo na bhenaangota. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ayesu pabhakaalobholelanga, “Nga nenga,” bhakabhujanga nnyuma na kugwee pahi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ngapena Ayesu akaakonyanga kabhele, “Ntendanga kwolela aganiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Na bhenaangota bhakajangulanga, “Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Ndekunnobholelanga kubhee, nga nenga,” “Henela handa ntendakunolea nenga, mwaalekenge habha bhandu bhajaulange.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ayesu akalobhola genago ili likweele lyenilyela lilobhe lyakalobhola, “Atati, bhandu bhenibhala bhankambekea nanganhobhea hata jumo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Asimoni yakubhee Ayesu akaakema Apetulo akaguolomola upanga na kunheketa lichikilo lya kunnelo antumichi jwa akung'i akolo. Ntumichi jonojwe akemitwa Amalukusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ayesu akaalagia Apetulo, “Mmujie upanga gwinu muligonelo lyakwe. Bholi, ngotokupetela hibhini yeniyela yakubhee Atati bhangu chibhapalite mbetele?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu apelekwa akung'i akolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ngapena bhenibhala manyemba na jonijola akolo bha manyemba bha Bhayahudi na akaalendelei bha Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhakaakamula Ayesu, na kuntabha kwa migoji, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />bhakaapeleka oti kwa Aanasi. Aanasi akibha akimundu jwa Akayafa, Akayafa nga jwakibha akung'i akolo kwa chenichela chaaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Jono Akayafa nga jwakaalobholelanga Bhayahudi, mbaya mundu jumo akomekwe ligongo lya bhandu bhoa.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo atendakunkana Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Amatayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Amaluko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Aluka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Asimoni Petulo na jwaachijigana jumo jwakankagula Ayesu. Jwachijigana jonojwe jongi akibha atendakumanyika kwa akung'i akolo, henela akajingila pamo na Ayesu mu chebule ja akung'i akolo. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Penapo Apetulo akajema panja panniyango. Ngapena jwaachigana jongi jwaamanyikana na akolo jwa akung'i akabhoka panja, akalongela mwikege jwalendela nniyango, ngapena mwikege jonojwe akaalekelea Apetulo kujingila nkati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Jonijola mwikege alendei bha nniyango akaakonya Apetulo, “Bholi, mwenga ngabha jumo jwa hojo mundu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Apetulo akaajangula, “Hopo, nenga ngabha jwaachijigana bhabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Bhenibhala akaatumichi na akaalendei bhakakungananga mooto gwa makalakala, ligongo pakibha na malili. Apetulo akibha ajemite pamo na bhenaangota abhi kujota mooto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akung'i akolo atendakwakonya Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Amatayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Amaluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Aluka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Muda genago pagatendita kupitila, akung'i akolo akaakonya Ayesu ngani ja bhabhachijigana bhabhe pamo na majigano gabhe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Ndekulongela na bhandu bhoa palugwinjili. Machobha goa ndenditakujigana mu Nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi na kuchali na mu Nyuumba ya Annoongo, monomwe nga pabhatendita kongananga Bhayahudi bhoa. Nangalongela chikubho choachela kwa chitikita. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kwa niki ntendakonya nenga? Mwakonyange bhandu bhabhatekujoa genigala ganakaalobholelanga bhenaangota bhatendakumanya chinakalobhola.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ayesu pabhakalongela gangani, alendei jumo jwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo jwaakajema pakubhandikila akaapota Ayesu likopi akalobhola, “Jenejo nga namuna ja kwajangula henela akung'i akolo?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Handa ndekulobhola chikubho chibohu, muchilongele chikubho chenecho nnongi ja habha bhandu. Nambo handa ndekulobhola ukweli, kwa niki ntekumbota?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ngapena Ayesu abhi atabhitwe kwa migoji, Aanasi akaapeleka Ayesu Akayafa yakubhee nga akung'i akolo.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo atendakunkana Ayesu kabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Amatayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Amaluko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Aluka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Muda gonogwe Asimoni Petulo akibha ajemite penapo abhikujota mooto. Henela bhandu bhangi bhabhakibha penapo bhakaakonya, “Bholi, mwenga ngabha jumo jwa bhabhachijigana bhabhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Apetulo akakana, akalobhola, “Hopo, nenga ngabha jwaachijigana bhabhe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Jumo jwa abhanda bha akung'i akolo, alongo jwa jonijola jwakaheketwa lichikilo na Apetulo, akaakonya, “Bholi, mwenga nangammona na jonojwe konikola mu buchitani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Apetulo akaakana kabhele, na popopo likambaliko likajemba.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu apelekwa kwa Apilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Amatayo 27:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Amaluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Aluka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Kundabhi tuputupu akachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhakaatola Ayesu kubhoka mu Nyuumba ja Akayafa na kupelekwa ku Nyuumba ja akolo bha ku Loma. Akaachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhangajingilanga nkati ja nyuumba jenejo ligongo bhangapalanga bhakotokondekwa kwaachalila Annoongo. Ili bhakombolange kulyee chakulya cha lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Henela Apilato akabhoka panja, akaakonyanga, “Bholi, ntendakwatakia hojo mundu kwa kulemwa chiniki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bhakaajangula, “Handa hojo mundu akabhihopo abohu, tukaaletitehopo kwachinu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Apilato akaalobholelanga, “Bahi, muntolange nkaahukumule kwa Malagio ginu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Bhayahudi bhakaajangula, “Tweenga twangali ukolo gwa kwakoma mundu joajola.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Gatendike gangani ili chenichela chibhakalondola Ayesu chikwele, kulangia apakujomokabholi.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ngapena Apilato akajingila nkati ja nyuumba jabhe ja chimwenye, bhakalagia bhaalete Ayesu kwaachabhe, akaakonya “Mwenga nga Amwenye bha Bhayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Bholi, gangani gangonya nenga nga maganikilo ginu au bhandu bhangi bhatekunnobholela ngani yangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Apilato akaajaangula, “Mganikia nenga na Ayahudi? Bhandu bhinu na akung'i akolo bhannetite kwaachangu. Nnemwite chiniki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Ayesu akajangula, “Umwenye gwangu ngabha gwa pachilambo heche. Handa Umwenye gwangu gukabhee gwa pambani pachilambo bhabhangagula nenga bhakambotanile ili ngotokamulikwa na Bhayahudi. Nambo Umwenye gwangu ngabha gwa chilambo heche.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Apilato akaakonya, “Mwenga nga Amwenye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Ayesu akaajangula, “Mwenga ntekulobhola kubhee nenga nga Amwenye. Nenga ndekubhelekwa na ndekuhika pachilambo ligongo lya genago, kwaalobholelanga bhandu ngani ja ukweli. Mundu joajola jwakagula ukweli atendakunyoanikia.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Apilato akaakonya, “Ukweli nga chiniki?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Ayesu ahukumikwa kujomoka</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Amatayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Amaluko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Aluka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ngapena Apilato akapita kabhele panja na kwalobholelanga akaachilongola bha Bhayahudi bhabhatekwatakia Ayesu, “Nangakolela kulemwa kohakola kwa hojo mundu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Nambo mwangota ntekuyobhalelanga kubhee muda gwa lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka nenga ndendakwajogolela ntabhwa jumo. Bholi mwapalanga naajogolele abha Amwenye bha Bhayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bhenaangota bhakapotanga nyenye bhabhikulobhola, “Ngabha hojo mundu! Ntujogolele Abalaba!” Abalaba akibha apoki.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ngapena Apilato akaakulumikia Ayesu apetulikwe apotekwe hiyakato. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nabhena manyemba bhakatota hiingwa ya miibha bhakaaweka Ayesu mmutwe. Ngapena bhakaaweka chiwalo cha chimwenye cha chambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Bhandu bhakibhanga bhatendakwelanga kabhele na kabhele penipala pabhabhile mu nyuumba ja chimwenye, na kulobholanga, “Kunchelile Amwenye bha Bhayahudi!” Kongo bhabhikumpotanga makopi kumiho.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Apilato akabhoka kabhele panja na akaalobholelanga bhenibhala bhabhakalondanika, “Nnolange ndendakunneta abha mundu kwaachinu, na muhimanyange kubhee nangakulola kulemwa kohakola kwa kwaahukumula.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Penapo Ayesu akabhoka panja, kongo jwawalite jenijela hiingwa ja miibha na chenichela chiwalo cha Chimwenye. Apilato akaalobholelanga, “Nnolange mundu jwinu hojo pambani!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Bhenibhala bha akakung'i akolongwa na akaalendei bha Nyuumba ja Annoongo pabhakaalola Ayesu bhakapotanga nyenye, “Mwaabhambe panchalaba! Mwaabhambe panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Apilato akaalobholelanga, “Muntolange mwangota mwabhene mkaabhambe panchalaba, nenga ngabhona kulemwa kohakola kwa kwahukumula.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bhayahudi bhakaajangula, “Twenga tutekola Lilagilo na kwa lilagilo lyenelyo apalikwa akomekwe, ligongo akalongela kubhee jonojwe nga Mwana jwa Mundu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Apilato pabhakajoa genago, akajogopa muno.<verse eid="JHN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Bahi, Apilato akaatola Ayesu na kujingila nabho nkati na kwaakonya, “Mmokite koji mwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Nambo Ayesu jwangajangula choachela. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Apilato akaalobholela, “Nkana kulongela na nenga, ngahimanya kubhee nenga ndekubhee na ukolo gwa kunnekelela au ukolo gwa kummamba panchalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Ayesu akajangula, “Mkabhilehopo na ukolo kwangu nenga handa nkagapata kubhoka kwa kunani, ligongo ukolo gonogwe mpatite kwa Annoongo. Henela mundu jonijola jwanetite kwaachinu akweti mabohu makolongwa muno.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Apilato pabhakajoa henela akalolea ndela ja kwaajogola Ayesu. Nambo Bhayahudi bhakapundanga kupota nyenye bhabhikulobhola, “Handa mpakwaalekelela ngabha aganja bha akolo bha ku Loma! Mundu joajola jwachitemba kubhee jono nga amwenye atendakunkana akolo bha ku Loma!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Bahi, Apilato pabhakajoa malobhe genago, akaaleta Ayesu panja kabhele akatama nnani ja chitengu chabhe cha kuhukumula bhandu, chehemu jijikemitwa payagalilikwe kwa maganga, kwa Chiebulania pakemitwa, “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Jikibha saa sita muhi. Muda gwa kupanganikia Pasaka, Apilato akaalobholelanga Bhayahudi, “Abha pambani Amwenye bhinu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Nambo bhenaangota bhakapotanga nyenye bhabhikulobholanga, “Mwakome! Mwakome! Mwabhambe panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Apilato akaakonyanga, “Bholi, naabhambe panchalaba Amwenye bhinu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Bhenibhala akaakung'i akolo bhakaajangula, “Twenga twanga Amwenye ila nga akolo bha ku Loma jika.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ngapena Apilato akaabhoa Ayesu akaakamuanga ili bhambhambe panchalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Ayesu atendakubhambwa panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Amatayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Amaluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Aluka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ngapena manyemba bhakaatola Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ayesu akajaula, kongo agupetwile nchalaba gwabhe, akabhoka kujaula mahali papakemitwa, “Lingambwa lya Mutwe.” Kwa Chiebulania pakemitwa, “Goligota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Penapo nga pabhakaabhamba Ayesu panchalaba, hela hela bhakabhambwa bhandu bhabhele, jumo nchalaba gwabhe gukibha upande gwa kunchiji na jongi nchalaba gwabhe gukibha upande gwa kunnelo gwa nchalaba gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Ngapena Apilato akajandika mu chibao, “Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti, Amwenye bha Bhayahudi.” Na akachibheka panani ja nchalaba gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bhayahudi bhajingi bhakachomanga majandiko genago gagabhile pachibao chenecho ligongo chikibha chibhandikile na pannyini, chibao chenecho chichikajandikwa kwa chilongelo cha Chiebulania, Chigiliki na Chilatini. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Bahi, akakolonga bha akaakung'i bhakaalobholela Apilato, “Nkotokujandika, ‘Amwenye bha Bhayahudi,’ ila, ‘Jonojwa akalobhola henela, nenga nga Amwenye bha Bhayahudi.’”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Apilato akaajangula, “Gagandekujandika, ndekugajandika!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Manyemba pabhakajomola kwaabhamba panchalaba Ayesu, bhakahitolanga ngobho yabhenji bhakahibhekanga mu malubhalo ncheche, kila linyemba na lilubhalo lyakwe. Hela hela bhakatolanga ngobho jabhe jangatotwa na ngobho jijikatotwa kubhokela nnani mpaka pahi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Manyemba gakalobholelana, “Tukotokujipapula ila kujitendelele gudugudu jibhee tumanye ganiki jwaapakujipata.” Chikubho hecho chikatendeka ili gakweele genigala Majandiko gagaakalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bhakagabhananga hiwalo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na ngobho yangu bhakaityendelela gudugudu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Bahi, henela nga chibhakatenda manyemba bhenabho.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Muda gonogwe kubhandikila na nchalaba gwa Ayesu bhakibha bhajemitinge, Amalia, anyongo jwabhe, Amalia alombo jwa anyongo bhabhe jwakibha hanu jwa Akilopa na Amalia bha ku Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Ayesu paakaabhona anyongo jwabhe penipala, na jwaajigana jwabhe jwakaapala muno ajemite penipala, akalobholela anyongo jwabhe, “Anyongo, nnole jonojwe nga mwana jwinu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ngapena, Ayesu akaalobholela jonijola jwaajigana, “Jonojwe nga anyongo bhinu.” Na kubhokela penapo jwaachijigana akaatola Amalia, atame nabho mu nyuumba jakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakujomoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Amatayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Amaluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Aluka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Pagakapeta genago, Ayesu pbhakahimanya kubhee ajomwile kupangana mahengo gabhe ili Majandiko ga Annoongo gakweele, akalobhola, “Ndekola nyoota.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Penapo pakibha na bakuuli lilitwelile divai jakunjunjulukana. Bahi bhakachubhika lidodoki mu divai jakunjunjulukana, bhakaahibheka mu nkongo gwa hisopo, bhakammekela pakang'wa. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ayesu pabhakajipaa jenejo divai ja kunjunjuluka, Ayesu akalobhola, “Lihengo litekujomoka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Ngapena akakotima mutwe gwabhe, akajomoka.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Linyemba atendakwahoma Ayesu nkoha mulubhahu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Likibha lichobha lya kuchiandaa na Lichobha lya Kupomolela. Akaakolo bha Bhayahudi bhangapalanga mimele hiigalile mu michalabha mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela na Kuchalila. Kwa kubhee lichobha lya kupomolela helyo likibha mu lichobha lya Pasaka. Bhayahudi bhakaajopa Apilato alagie makongono ga bhandu bhoa bhabhatekubhambwa panchalaba bhajiekete na mimele jabhenji bhajitwulue pamichalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Bahi, manyemba bhakajaulanga, bhakahengelana makongono ga mundu jwakujemeka, hela hela bhakahengelana makongono ga jonijola jongi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Nambo pabhakaahikila Ayesu, bhakabhona yakubhee bhatekujomoka, henela bhangaahengelana makongono gabhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nambo Linyemba jumo akaahoma Ayesu mulubhahu kwa nkoa, na palapala ikaabhoka mihai na machi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Jonojwe jwakabhonite chikubho hecho chibhatenda kupitila nga atekutulobhobholela ili twenga tuhobhalelange. Na genago gaatekutulobholela nga kweli, kabhele jonojwe atendakuhimanya kubhee atendakulobhola ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Chikubho hecho chikatendeka ili gakweele genigala Majandiko gagatekulobhola, “Gwaakwa hata nhupa gwabhe gumo gugupakuhengelekwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kabhele Majandiko gangi galobhola, “Bhapakwalola jonijola bhabhatekwahoma nkoha.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakuchikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Amatayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Amaluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Aluka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Pachikapeta chikubho chenecho, Ayosefu jwakubhoka kuchilambo cha Alimataya jwaakibha jwaachijigana jwa ayesu kwa kuchiiya, akaajopa Apilato ampekee mmele gwa Ayesu. Ligongo atendita kwaajogopa akaakolongwa bha Bhayahudi. Apilato akaalobholela Ayosefu agutole mmele gwa Ayesu, henela Ayosefu akajaula kugutola mmele gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Anikodemu jonijola jwakaakagula Ayesu kilo nabhena akahika, Anikodemo akaleta ubhumba gugutekuhangalana na mahuta ga bei ngolongwa gakunungila gagakemitwa manemane na ubhani, na gagakibha na kilo handa makomi gatatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bahi, bhandu habho bhabhele bhakagutola mmele gwa Ayesu na bhakaguhililila chaanda pamo na mahuta gakunungila, handa chiiyobhalilike kwa Bhayahudi mu kuchikanga. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Henela mahali penapo pabhakabhambwa Ayesu pakibha na buchitani ja mikongo na mubuchitani jenejo pakibha na mbako jiyono yakubhee jwakwa mundu jwakachikwa mu mbako jenejo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ligongo likibha lichobha lya Bhayahudi lya kuchiandaa na Lichobha lya Kupomolela, na ligongo mbako jenejo jikabhandikila, bhakagubheka monomwe mmele gwa Ayesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Amatayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Amaluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Aluka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Tuputupu lichobha lya kujemeka lya juuma, kukibha tangu na lubhendu, Amalia bha ku Magidala akajaula kumbako, akalibhona lyenilyela liganga lilikabhee pannyango gwa mbako litekubhokekwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Henela akabhutuka lubhelo mpaka kwa Asimoni Apetulo pamo na jonijola jwaachijigana jongi yakubhee Ayesu akaapala, akaalobholelanga, “Bhagubhoite mmele gwa Hangwana mumbako na ngahimanya kubhagubhekite!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Apetulo na jonijola jwaachijigana jongi bhakajaulanga kumbako. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bhoa bhabhele bhakabhutukanga, nambo jonijola jwaachijigana jongi akabhutuka muno kupunda Apetulo, akalongolela kuhika kumbako. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Pabhakakotima na kulingulila monimola kumbako, akahibhona chaanda jiika hibhekitwe penipala, nambo jwangajingila nkati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ngapena Asimoni Apetulo jwakibha kuyeto ja jonijola jwachijigana akahika akajingila mumbako. Jonojwe akahikokela chaanda jiika penipala pahi, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />pamo na chenichela chipande cha chitambaa chibhaakatabha Ayesu mmutwe. Chene chipande cha chitambaa changabhekwa pamo na jene chanda, ila chitekuchihiligana chibhile pajikajabhe. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ngapena jonijola jwaachijigana jwakalongolela kuhika kumbako, hela hela akajingila nkati akabhona, akahobhalela. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Bhakibhanga tangu bhangahelewanga Majandiko ga Annoongo gagakalobhola kubhee Ayesu apaalikwa kuyoka. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Bahi, bhabhachijigana bhenabho bhakabhujanga kaja.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwabhokela Amalia jwa ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9">Amatayo 28:9</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Amaluko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Amalia jwa Kumagidala akajema panja ja mbako, kongo abhikuguta. Pabhatenditakuguta, akakotimia kulingulila monimola mumbako, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akabhabhonanga Akaatumichi bhabhele bha kunani kwa Annoongo bhawalitinge ngobho hiyuu, bhatamitinge penipala mmele gwa Ayesu pagukibha gutekugonekwa, jumo akatama upande gwa mutwe na jongi akatama upande gwa makongono. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo bhenibhala bhakaakonya Amalia, “Bholi, amma, ng'utila niki?” Nabhena Akaalobholelanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">“Ndendakuguta ligongo bhagupetwile mmele gwa Hangwana na ngakumanya kubhatekugubheka.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, Amalia akatendebhuka kuyeto, akaammona Ayesu ajemite penipala, nambo jwangaamanya kubhee akibha nga Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Ayesu akaakonya Amalia, “Amma, ng'utila niki? Ntendakunnolea aganiki?” Amalia akaganikia jwaalongela nabho nga mundu jwakulolekea buchitani, henela akaalobholela, “Hangwana, handa nga mwenga ntekunpetula, choonde nnangie koji kugumekite, nanenga mbakugutolatola”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Amalia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Amalia akatendebhukia akaalobholela kwa chilongelo cha Chiebulania, “Laboni!” Maana gakwe Bhannyigana.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nkotokungamula, ligongo tangu nangajaula kwa Atati. Nambo nnyaule kwa akaalongo bhangu nkaalobholelange, ndendakujaula kunani kwa Atati jwangu na Atati jwinunji, Annoongo jwangu na Annoongo jwinunji.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Penapo Amalia bha ku Magidala akajaula kwaalobholelanga bhabhachijigana bha Ayesu, ndekummona Hangwana nabhena akaalobholelanga kubhee atekwaalobholela genago goha.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwabhokela bhabhajigana bhabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Amatayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Amaluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Aluka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Jikabhee kimuho ja lichobha lyela lya kujemeka juuma, Bhabhaajigana bhabhe bhakibha bhatekongana pamo munyuumba, kongo milyango jikibha jitabhwitwe kwa kubhee bhakaajogopanga Akaachilongola bha Bhayahudi. Bahi, Ayesu akahika, akajema pakati jabhenji akaalobholelanga, “Ntamange kwa kuhengwa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Paakajomola kwaalobholelanga henela, Ayesu akabhalangianga mabhoko gabhe na ubhahu gwabhe. Henela bhabhachijijigana bhabhe pabhakaamona Hangwana bhakahachukanga pangali kupela. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga kabhele, “Ntamange kwa kuhengwa! Handa Atati chibhandumite nenga, nanenga ndendakuntumanga mwangota.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Paakajomola kulobhola genago, akaapepetelanga mboomo akaalobholelanga, “Mpokelange Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Handa mpakwalekelanga bhandu mabohu, bhandu bhenabho Annoongo apakwalekelanga gena mabohu. Nambo handa ngaalekelelanga bhandu mabohu gabhenji, nabhenabho ngalekelelwa mabohu gabhenji.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwabhokela Atomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Atomasi, jumo jwa bhenibhala bhabhachijigana komi na bhabhele jwaakakemwa Mabhela, jwangabhee penapo na bhenaangota Ayesu pabhaabhokela. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Henela bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhangi bhakaalobholela, “Tutekummona Hangwana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Nambo Atomasi akaalobholelanga, “Handa nangagabhona mabhai genago ga michumali mmabhoko gabhe na kukwaa lukonji lwangu mu mabhai genago ga michumali na lukonji lwangu mulubahu lwabhe, ngahobhalela ng'o.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Pagakapeta machobha ganane, bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakibhanga pamo munyuumba na jonojwe Atomasi akibha pamo nabho. Kongo minniango jibhi jitabhwitwe Ayesu akajema pakati jabhenji akalobhola, “Ntamange kwa kuhengwa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholela Atomasi, “Mmeke lukonji lwinu pambani na nnole mabhoko gangu, nnyulule lubhoko lwinu nkwae mulubahu lwangu. Nkotokubhee na lipamba nambo nhobhalele tu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Atomasi akaajangula, “Hangwana bhangu na Annoongo bhangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Ntekuhobhalela ligongo ntekumona? Bhatekutendelwa gammbone na Annoongo, bhenibhala bhabhahobhalelanga pangali kumona!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ligongo lya kujandika chitabu heche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Ayesu akatenda hilolelo hijingi yengi nnongi ja bhabhachijigana bhabhe, nambo yangajandikwa muchitabu heche. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Nambo ngani heye hitekujandikwa ili mkombolange kuhobhalela yakubhee Ayesu nga Akilisito, Mwana jwa Annoongo na kwa kunhobhalela mmangange na umomi gwa machobha goa kwa kutama nkati jabhe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwabhokela bhabhachijigana bhabhe chaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Pagakapeta genago, Ayesu akaabhokela kabhele bhabhachijigana bhabhe nngulugulu ja litanda lya Tibelia. Henela nga chibhakaabhokelanga, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Asimoni Apetulo, Atoma jwakemitwa Mabhela, na Anatanaeli jwakabhokela ku Kana ja Ku Galilaya, bhaana bha Azebedayo na bhabhachijigana bhangi bhabhele bha Ayesu bhoha bhakibhanga pamo. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Asimoni Apetulo akaalobholenga akaajabhe, “Ndendakujaula koka homba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Bhenaangota bhakaalobholela, “Tupakujaula pamo na mwenga.” Bhakabhoka, bhakajingilanga nkati ja ntumbwi nkolongwa, nambo kilo chela choa bhangapatanga homba. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kundabhi tuputupu, Ayesu akajema kuntundu ja litanda, nambo bhabhachijigana bhangaamanyanga kubhee akibha Ayesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Ngapena Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Bholi, akanangwendo bhangu ntekupatanga homba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bhakajangula, “Elo! Twangapata homba.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Ntuluange mapelele upande gwa kunnelo gwa ntumbwi, na mwangota mpakupatanga hoomba.” Bhakatuluanga mapelele mmachi kwa upande gonogwe na bhakapatanga hoomba hijingi muno, bhakapatanga homba hijingi hata bhangakombolanga kuhuta mapelele gabhenji.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ngapena jonijola jwachijigana jwakapalikwa muno na Ayesu akaalobholela Apetulo, “Eheee! Habha nga Hangwana!” Palapala Asimoni Petulo pabhakajoa yakubhee jonijola nga Hangwana, akawala ngobho jabhe kwa kubhee bhakibha bhangawala, ngapena akahombela mmachi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nambo bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhangi bhakahikanga kuntumbwi nkolongwa kongo bhabhikuhuta lyenilyela lipelele lilikatwelela hoomba, bhangabhee kutali na chilambo chijomo, ila bhakibhanga handa mita mia kubhoka palikajemeka litanda. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Pabhakahikanga pachilambo lijomo, bhakagukolelanga mooto gwa makalakala na hoomba hibhekitwe nnani jakwe na mikate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Mbekeange hoomba yengi hinkokitinge.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Bahi, Asimoni Apetulo akajingila muntumbwi nkolongwa, akahuuta lipelele kumbwani mwa litanda, lilitwelile hoomba hikolongwa mia jimo hanchini na tatu. Hata handa bhakibhanga homba hijingi henela, lyenilyela lipelele lyangapapuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Nhikange nnabhukange.” Nambo jwakwa hata jumo pakati ja bhabhachijigana bhabhe jwakajiga kwaakonya, “Mwenga nga aganiki?” Kwa kubhee bhakamanyanga kubhee nga Hangwana. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Henela Ayesu akajaula, akagutola gonigola nkate akaametulilanga, na akatenda henela kwa yeniyela homba. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Jenjeni jikibha mala ja tatu Ayesu kwabhokelanga bhabhachijigana bhabhe tangu pabhakayoka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwapekea malagilo Apetulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pabhakajomolanga kulyee, Ayesu akaakonya Asimoni Apetulo, “Bholi, Asimoni, mwana jwa Ayohana! Ntendakumbala nenga kupunda abha bhangi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Nabhena akajangula, “Eloo Hangwana, mwenga muhimanyi nenga ndendakumpala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ayesu akaalobholela, “Mwapekee chakulya bhanangondolo bhangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Ngapena Ayesu akaakonya pabhele Apetulo, “Asimoni mwana jwa Ayohana, ntendakumbala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Apetulo akaajangula, “Elo, Hangwana muhimanyi kubhee mwenga ndendakumpala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nnolekee bhanangondolo bhangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Akaakonya kabhele Apetulo patatu, “Asimoni mwana jwa Ayohana, ntendakumbala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Apetulo akahechuka muno kwa kubhee Ayesu akaakonya patatu, “Ntendakumbala?” Akaajangula, “Hangwana, mwenga ntendakugamanya goha, ntendakuhimanya kubhee ndendakumpala.” Ayesu akaalobholela, “Mwapekeange chakulya bhanangondolo bhangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ndendakunnobholela ukweli, pamwakibha akakombo nkawala na kujaula kumkupala, nambo pampakongopala mpakunyulula mabhoko ginu na mundu jongi apakuntabha nkanda na kumpeleka mwangapala kujaula.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwa kulobhola henela Ayesu akalangia namuna Apetulo chibhapakujomoka ili kwaapekea ukolo Annoongo, ngapena akaalobholela, “Ngagule!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu na jwaachijigana jongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Penapo Apetulo akatendebhuka na akaabhona jwaachijiga jongi kuyeto, akaabhokana jonijola jwachijigana jwakapalikwa muno na Ayesu, atenda kunkagula. Jono jwaajigana nga jonijola jwakatama kubhandikila na Ayesu kulyee chakulya cha lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka, jwakaakonya, “Hangwana, nga aganiki jwapakung'aluka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Bahi, Apetulo pabhakalola jwaachijigana jonojwe, akaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, niki chipakubhokela kwa habha?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Handa ndendakupala atame jwamomi mpaka pambakubhuja, mwenga jitendakunhuchu niki? Mwenga ngagule!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Bahi ngani hejo jikajenela pakati ja bhenibhala bhabhachijigana kubhee ngajomoka. Nambo Ayesu jwangalobhola kubhee ngajomoka. Nambo akalobhola, “Handa ndendakupala atame jwamomi mpaka pambakubhuja, mwenga jitendakunhuchu niki?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ojojo nga jonijola jwachijigana jwaatekuhilola ngani heye na kujandika, na twenga tutendakuhimanya kubhee gabhatekulobhola nga ga kweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe ga kujomolekea ga Ayohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Hibhile hikubho yengi hijingi yakubhee Ayesu akatenda. Handa yoa hikajandikwa chimo kwa chengi, ndendakuganikia chilambo choa chikapelile pakubheka hitabu yoa yakubhee hikajaandikwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>